  <para style="h">2 Abami</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca kabiri c’Abami</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Abami</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca kabiri</para>
  <para style="mt1">c’Abami</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> acira urubanza Ahaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ahabu amaze gupfa, Abanyamowabu baca bagarariza Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Umusi umwe umwami mushasha wa Isirayeli yitwa Ahaziya akoroka aciye mw’idirisha ry’icumba ciwe co hejuru i Samariya, arakomereka cane. Aca atuma intumwa ziwe kumubariza Bayali-Zebubi, ikigirwamana co muri Ekuroni, nimba azokira ico gikomere.<verse eid="2KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Ariko umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Eliya w’i Tishubi ati: “Haguruka ugende guhura n’intumwa z’umwami w’i Samariya uzibaze uti: ‘Mbega ni kubera yuko muri Isirayeli ata Mana iriho aho muja kubaza Bayali-Zebubi, ikigirwamana c’abo muri Ekuroni?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Aho uryamye ntuzohavyuka, nta nkeka uzopfa.’ ” Nuko Eliya aragenda arabibabwira.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Za ntumwa zisubiye inyuma, umwami arazibaza ati: “Ni kubera iki munyarutse kugaruka?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Na zo ziramwishura ziti: “Hari umugabo twahuye, atubwira ati: ‘Subira inyuma ku mwami yabarungitse mumubwire muti: <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: Mbega aho muja kubaza Bayali-Zebubi, ikigirwamana c’abo muri Ekuroni, ni kubera yuko ata Mana iri muri Isirayeli? Ati none rero ubwo buriri uryamyeko ntuzobuvako, nta nkeka uzopfa.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Umwami na we arababaza ati: “Uwo muntu mwahuye akababwira ivyo yari ameze gute?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Bamwishura bati: “Yari umugabo yambaye umutamana w’ubwoya, akenyeje umukanda w’urusato.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Umwami aca avuga ati: “Uwo ni Eliya w’i Tishubi, nta wundi.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Aca arungika umukuru w’abasoda mirongo itanu hamwe n’ingabo ziwe kuja gufata Eliya. Basanga yicaye hejuru ku gasozi. Uwo mukuru w’abasoda amubwira ati: “Muntu w’Imana, umwami avuze ngo nuze tumanukane.”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Nimba ndi umuntu w’Imana, umuriro numanuke uvuye mw’ijuru, ubatikize mwese n’abasoda bawe uko ari mirongo itanu!” Ubwo nyene umuriro uca urakoroka uvuye mw’ijuru, utongora uwo mukuru w’abasoda n’abasoda biwe bose.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Umwami arasubira arungika umukuru w’abasoda mirongo itanu hamwe n’izo ngabo ziwe. Uwo mukuru w’abasoda aragenda amubwira ati: “Muntu w’Imana, umwami avuze ngo umanuke vuba!”<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Nimba ndi umuntu w’Imana, umuriro numanuke uvuye mw’ijuru, ubatikize mwese n’abasoda bawe uko ari mirongo itanu!” Ubwo nyene umuriro uca urakoroka uvuye mw’ijuru, utongora uwo mukuru w’abasoda n’abasoda biwe bose.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Umwami aca arongera arungika umukuru w’abasoda mirongo itanu agira gatatu hamwe n’izo ngabo ziwe. Uwo mukuru araduga, ashikira Eliya aramupfukamira, amubwira amwinginga ati: “Muntu w’Imana, ndakwinginze ugirire impuhwe amagara yanje n’ay’aba basavyi bawe mirongo itanu. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Raba umuriro umaze gukoroka kabiri kose utongora abakuru b’ingabo hamwe n’ingabo zabo zose. Ndakwinginze ugirire imbabazi ubuzima bwanje.”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Eliya ati: “Manukana na we, kandi ntugire ubwoba.” Eliya aca arahaguruka amanukana na we aho umwami yari ari.<verse eid="2KI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Ashitse aca abwira umwami ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Mbega ni kubera yuko muri Isirayeli ata Mana iriho aho utuma intumwa kubaza Bayali-Zebubi, imana y’abo muri Ekuroni nimba uzokira? Ko wakoze ivyo, ubwo buriri uryamyeko ntuzobuvako, nta nkeka uzopfa.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Hanyuma Ahaziya arapfa nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryaciye kuri Eliya ryari ryavuze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:17">Kubera ko Ahaziya ata muhungu yari yaravyaye, mwenewabo Yoramu ni we yaciye amusubirira ku ngoma ya Isirayeli, aho hari mu mwaka ugira kabiri Yehoramu mwene Yehoshafati ari ku ngoma i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ahaziya n’ivyo yakoze vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya aduganwa mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagomba gutwara Eliya mw’ijuru akoresheje agashururu, Eliya yari kumwe na Elisa bari mu rugendo bava i Gilugali. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Eliya abarira Elisa ati: “Wewe sigara ngaha; kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> antumye i Beteli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Ariko Elisa amubwira ati: “Ndakurahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kubaho kwawe, ko ntakuva i ruhande.” Nuko baca baramanukana i Beteli.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Umugwi w’abavugishwa bari i Beteli babarira Elisa bati: “Mbega wamenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kugutwara shobuja uwu musi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Elisa arabishura ati: “Egome nabimenye, ariko ntimubivuge!”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Eliya abwira Elisa ati: “Wewe sigara aha, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> antumye i Yeriko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Elisa amwishura ati: “Ndakurahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kubaho kwawe, ko ntakuva i ruhande.” Nuko bajana i Yeriko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Umugwi w’abavugishwa baba i Yeriko babwira Elisa bati: “Mbega wamenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kugutwara Shobuja uwu musi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Elisa yishura ati: “Egome nabimenye, ariko ntimubivuge!”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Eliya abwira Elisa ati: “Wewe sigara ngaha, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> antumye kuri Yorodani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Elisa yishura ati: “Ndakurahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kubaho kwawe, ko ntakuva i ruhande.” Nuko barajana.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Mirongo itanu bo muri wa mugwi w’abavugishwa barabakurikira, bihweza Eliya na Elisa bahagaze kure, babaraba aho bari bahagaze i ruhande y’uruzi Yorodani. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Eliya yambura umutamana wiwe, arawuzingazinga, awukubita amazi y’urwo ruzi. Ubwo nyene ruca rwicamwo kabiri, amazi amwe ahagarara i buryo ayandi i bubamfu, abo bagabo baca bajabuka nk’abagendera kw’isi yumutse.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Bamaze kujabuka, Eliya abarira Elisa ati: “Mbwira ico wipfuza ko ndagukorera imbere y’uko ntandukanywa nawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Elisa na we ati: “Mpa incuro zibiri umugabane w’impwemu yawe.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Eliya amwishura ati: “Unsavye ikintu kigoye, ariko niwabona ingene ntandukanywa nawe, uwo mugabane uraza kuwuronka. Ariko nutambona, nta wo uronka.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Bakiriko baragenda baganira, haza umukogote w’umuriro ukwegwa n’amafarasi y’umuriro, urabatandukanya, Eliya aduzwa mw’ijuru mu gashururu. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisa abonye ivyo, arasemerera ati: “Ewe data we, ewe data we! Wewe wabereye Isirayeli nk’imikogote n’abayigenderako!” Elisa ntiyaba akimubona, aca yitaburirako impuzu ayicamwo kubiri.<verse eid="2KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Aca atora umutamana wakorotse uva ku bitugu vya Eliya, hanyuma asubira inyuma, ahagarara ku nkengera y’uruzi Yorodani. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Afata wa mutamana wakoroka uva kuri Eliya, awukubita amazi y’urwo ruzi. Abaza ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya Eliya, uri hehe?” Akubise urwo ruzi ruca rucikamwo kubiri, amazi amwe ahagarara i buryo, ayandi i bubamfu, hanyuma arajabuka.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Maze bamwe bo muri wa mugwi w’abavugishwa b’i Yeriko bariko bararaba ivyariko biraba, baca bavuga bati: “Ya mpwemu ya Eliya isigaye kuri Elisa.” Baca baja kumusanganira, bikubita hasi imbere yiwe baramupfukamira. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Baramubwira bati: “Mugenzi, twebwe abasavyi bawe, turafise abantu mirongo itanu bakomeye twoshobora gutuma. Hamwe uvyemeye boca bagenda kurondera shobuja, kumbure Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yoba yamusize ku mataba y’imisozi canke mu biyaya.” Elisa abishura ati: “Oya, ntimubatume.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Ariko babandanya bamwinginga bakobeje, gushika aho vyamugoye ingene abankira. Arateba ababwira ati: “Nimugende.” Haca hagenda abantu mirongo itanu, bamara imisi itatu bamurondera ariko ntibashobora kumutora. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Bagarutse aho Elisa yari ari i Yeriko, arababwira ati: “Sinari nababujije kugenda?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa avura amazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Umusi umwe, abantu b’i Yeriko babwira Elisa bati: “Databuja, iki gisagara cacu kiri ahantu heza nk’uko nawe uvyibonera, ariko amazi yaco ni mabi, kandi isi yaho na yo ntimera.”<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Elisa arababwira ati: “Nimunzanire agakono gashasha, karimwo umunyu.” Nuko barakamuzanira.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Nuko aca aja aho ayo mazi yiburuka ava, atererayo wa munyu, avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Aya mazi ndayavuye. Ntazosubira na rimwe kuzana urupfu, canke ngo atere isi ukutamera.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Ayo mazi aca aba meza kuva uwo mwanya nk’uko Elisa yabivuze.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ashinyagurirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisa aca ava aho aja i Beteli. Akiri ku nzira agenda, haza abasore bakiri bato bavuye mu gisagara, baramushinyaguriza bamubwira bati: “Va ngaha, busa bw’ubuhanza! Va ngaha busa bw’ubuhanza!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Aca arahindukira, arabaraba abavuma mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Haca haza amadubu abiri y’ingore avuye mw’ishamba, atabagura mirongo ine na babiri muri abo bahungu. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Aca aja ku musozi Karumeli, avaho aja i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ukugarariza kwa Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yehoshafati ari umwami w’i Buyuda, ni ho Yehoramu mwene Ahabu yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, amara imyaka cumi n’ibiri ari ku ngoma i Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Yakoze ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ariko ntiyanganije ububi na se canke nyina. We yarakuyeho inkingi z’amabuye za Bayali se yari yarashinze. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Ariko yagendeye mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakwegeyemwo Abisirayeli. Ntiyigeze ava mu ngeso ziwe.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Kandi umwami Mesha w’i Mowabu yari umworozi w’intama, ku mwaka ku mwaka yategerezwa gushikanira umwami wa Isirayeli imyagazi y’intama ibihumbi ijana, hamwe n’ubwoya bw’impfizi z’intama ibihumbi ijana nyene. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Ariko Ahabu amaze gupfa, umwami wa Mowabu agarariza umwami wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Umwami Yehoramu ava i Samariya, aca akoranya abasoda ba Isirayeli bose. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Yongera arungikira ubutumwa Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda ati: “Umwami w’i Mowabu yangararije. Mbega ubona woza kumfasha tugatera Mowabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Aramwishura ati: “Nzogufasha, kuko urazi ko turi bamwe, abasoda banje ndabaguhaye, n’amafarasi yanje yose ndayaguhaye.”<verse eid="2KI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Yehoshafati na we aramubaza ati: “Ubona twojana inzira iyihe mu gutera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Yoramu amwishura ati: “Tuzoca mu bugaragwa bwa Edomu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Umwami wa Isirayeli ajana n’umwami w’i Buyuda hamwe n’uwa Edomu, maze bose bafata inzira izunguruka ubugaragwa, bamara imisi indwi bagenda, amazi batekeye arabaherana, babura ayo banywa n’ayo baha ibitungwa biri kumwe na bo.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Umwami wa Isirayeli aravuga ati: “Karabaye! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadukoranije turi abami batatu kugira ngo aturekurire mu maboko y’umwami wa Mowabu!”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Ariko Yehoshafati arabaza ati: “Hano nta muvugishwa w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umwe ahari kugira ngo atubarize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ico twokora?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Umwe mu bakuru b’ingabo z’Umwami wa Isirayeli amwishura ati: “Elisa mwene Shafati ari ngaha. Yahora ari umukozi wa Eliya.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehoshafati aravuga ati: “Uwo rero arafise ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Nuko umwami wa Isirayeli na Yehoshafati n’umwami wa Edomu baca bamanuka kumurondera.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisa aca abaza umwami wa Isirayeli ati: “Mbega twe nawe hari ico duhuriyeko? Genda ubaze ba bavugishwa ba so n’aba nyoko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Umwami wa Isirayeli aramwishura ati: “Oya, ni kubera ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadukoranije turi abami batatu, ngo aturekurire mu maboko y’umwami wa Mowabu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisa aramubwira ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana nkorera, iyo ntasonera Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda, sinari no kwirirwa ndakuraba canke ngo ndanakwiyumvire. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Ariko noneho nimuzanire umuvuzi w’inanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:15">Uwo muvuzi w’inanga ariko arayivuza, ububasha bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buza kuri Elisa, <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />aca ababwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Iki kiyaya nzocuzuza ibidengeri vy’amazi.<verse eid="2KI 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: Nta muyaga muzokwumva kandi nta mvura muzobona, ariko iki kiyaya kizokwuzura amazi, mwebwe ubwanyu, ibitungwa vyanyu vyose, muronke ico munywa.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Ariko ico ni ikintu gito cane <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba abakoreye, kuko n’Abanyamowabu azobarekurira mu maboko yanyu. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Muzosenyagura impome z’igisagara caho gikuru. Muzotemagura ibiti vyiza vyaho vyose, muzibire n’amariba yabo, indimiro nzizanziza zabo muzozisibanganisha amabuye.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Bukeye, nko mu gihe co gutanga ibimazi co mu gitondo, amazi yari yamaze gutemba ava muri Edomu, kandi igihugu cose cari cuzuye amazi.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Ico gihe Abanyamowabu bose baramenya ko abo bami baje kubatera, maze abantu bose bari bageze kuja ku rugamba, abakiri bato n’abakuze, barakorana, baja gutegerera ku mbibe. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Bukeye mu gatondo, izuba ryariko rirasira ku mazi, rigatuma asa n’amaraso mu maso y’Abanyamowabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Baravuga bati: “Ehe raba ariya maraso! Ba bami bategerezwa kuba bacanyemwo baricana. Yemwe Banyamowabu, haguruka tugende kwegeranya iminyago!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Ariko bageze ahari ikambi y’Abisirayeli, Abisirayeli baca barahaguruka barabagwanya, Abanyamowabu na bo barahunga. Abisirayeli barabakurikira bagenda barabica ingenda. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Basambura ibisagara vyaho, umuntu wese aterera ibuye mu murima mwiza wose gushika wuzuye amabuye. Basivya amariba yose, batemagura n’igiti ciza cose. Igisagara ca Kiru-Hareseti conyene ni co casigaye gikomeye, ariko na co nyene abasoda bateresha amabuye imigozi baragitera.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Umwami wa Mowabu abonye ko agiye kuneshwa ku rugamba, aca ahitana abasoda amajana indwi bagwanisha inkota ngo arabe uko boca mu ngabo z’umwami wa Edomu, ariko birabananira. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Aca afata umuhungu wiwe yomusubiriye ku ngoma, amutangako ikimazi co guturira, amuherereza ku ruzitiro hejuru. Abisirayeli baca basesemwa n’ico kintu kibi gutyo bavayo basubira mu gihugu cabo.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa agwiza amavuta ya Elayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Umusi umwe, umugore w’umwe mu bavugishwa n’Imana yaje aho Elisa ari, aramutakambira ati: “Umugabo wanje ari we musavyi wawe yarapfuye, kandi urazi ko yari umuntu yubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. None umuntu dufitiye umwenda aje gutwara abahungu banje ngo abagire abagurano biwe.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisa aramubwira ati: “None nokora iki kugira ngo ndagufashe? Hari ico ufise mu nzu yawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Na we amwishura ati: “Jewe umusavyikazi wawe nta co mfise uretse agacupa k’utuvuta twa elayo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisa amubwira ati: “Genda mu babanyi bawe utire ibivomesho, kandi ntutire bike. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Hanyuma uheze uvyinjirane mu nzu, mwiyugarane n’abahungu bawe. Maze usuke ayo mavuta muri ivyo bivomesho, icuzuye cose mugishire ku ruhande.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Nuko uwo mugore amusiga aho aragenda, abigira nk’uko yabimubwiye. Abahungu biwe bamuzanira vya bivomesho, na we abisukamwo ya mavuta, kimwekimwe ku kindi. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Vya bivomesho vyose vyuzuye, wa mugore abwira umwe mu bahungu biwe ati: “Nzanira ikindi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Na we amwishura ati: “Nta na kimwe gisigaye.” Ubwo nyene ya mavuta ntiyasubira kwisuka.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Wa mugore aca aja kubwira wa muntu w’Imana uko vyagenze, na we amubarira ati: “Genda ugurishe ayo mavuta hanyuma wishure umwenda wawe; amahera asigaye azoheza agutunge wewe n’abahungu bawe.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa asubiza ubuzima umwana yapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Umusi umwe Elisa aja gutembera mu gisagara ca Shunemu. Hariho umugore w’umutunzi yabayo, maze atumira Elisa gufungura iwe. Kuva ico gihe, uko Elisa arenganye yama acaho, akamuzimana. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Uwo mugore abarira umugabo wiwe ati: “Sinkekeranya, uwu mugabo yama aca ngaha ni umuntu w’Imana. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Reka tumwubakire icumba hejuru ku nzu, tumushirireyo uburiri, imeza, intebe hamwe n’itara. Niyasubira kugaruka, azoze araronka aho arara.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Umusi umwe, Elisa asubiye i Shunemu, aduga muri ca cumba co hejuru araruhuka. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Abwira umukozi wiwe Gehazi ati: “Mpamagarira uwo Munyashunemukazi.” Aramuhamagara, na we araza ahagarara imbere ya Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisa abwira Gehazi ati: “Mubwire uti: ‘Watwigoreye cane mu kudukorera ibi vyose. None natwe twogukorera iki? Tuje kukuvugira ku mwami canke ku mukuru w’ingabo?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Ariko uwo mugore amubwira ati: “Jewe nibereyeho neza mu muryango wanje.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisa abaza Gehazi ati: “Ubona twomukorera iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Na we ati: “Erega nta gahungu afise, kandi umugabo wiwe arashaje!”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Elisa abwira Gehazi ati: “Subira umumpamagarire.” Wa mugore araza ahagarara mu muryango. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Elisa amubwira ati: “Mu mwaka uza, igihe nicagera nk’aha iki kigeze, uzoba ukikiye umwana w’umuhungu mu maboko yawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Ariko uwo mugore amwishura ati: “Oya mugenzi, ntaco ubesha umusavyikazi wawe, kandi uri umuntu w’Imana.”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Ariko uwo mugore aca asama inda, mu mwaka ukurikira, mu gihe nk’ico nyene, avyara umwana w’umuhungu, nk’uko Elisa yari yabimubwiye.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Uwo mwana arakura, maze umusi umwe aja kuraba se mu mirima, aho yari kumwe n’abimbuzi. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Maze abwira se ati: “Ndamenetse umutwe! Ndamenetse umutwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Se aca abwira umwe mu bakozi biwe ati: “Muterure umushire nyina.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Wa mukozi amaze kumutwara kwa nyina, uwo mwana aca yicara ku bibero vyiwe gushika nk’igihe c’isaha zitandatu z’umurango, hanyuma arahwera. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Nyina aca aramudugana amuryamika ku buriri bwa wa muntu w’Imana, aca yugara umuryango arasohoka.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Aca atumako umugabo wiwe ati: “Ndungikira umukozi umwe n’indogoba, kugira ngo nkubitire kuraba wa mukozi w’Imana nca ngaruka.”<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Umugabo wiwe aramubaza ati: “Ni kubera iki ugiye kumuraba uwu musi kandi atari ku musi mukuru w’ukwezi canke kw’Isabato?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Umugore na we ati: “Oya nta na kimwe, ni amahoro.”<verse eid="2KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Aca arategura indogoba, abwira wa mukozi ati: “Hogi tugende twihuta, ntugende bukebuke, kiretse ndakubariye.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Nuko bafata inzira baragenda, bashikira wa muntu w’Imana ari ku musozi Karumeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Elisa ababonye bakiri kure, abwira Gehazi ati: “Ehe wa Munyashunemukazi! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Irukanga umutegere, umubaze uti: ‘Muri amahoro mwe n’umugabo wawe n’umwana wawe?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Na we yishura ati: “Turi amahoro.”<verse eid="2KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Ashikiriye wa muntu w’Imana ku musozi hejuru, yikubita hasi imbere yiwe, amufata ku birenge. Gehazi yegereye ngo amusunure amwigizeyo, Elisa amubwira ati: “Mureke, yuzuye umubabaro mu mutima, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabimpishije, ampisha n’icabitumye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Wa mugore abaza Elisa ati: “Mugenzi, mbega ni jewe nari nagusavye umwana? Sinari nakubujije kumpenda?”<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Elisa aca abwira Gehazi ati: “Fata umukanda ukenyeze neza umutamana wawe, ufate iyi nkoni yanje hanyuma wiruke. Nihagira abo muhura mu nzira ntimuramukanye, kandi nihagira abakuramutsa ntubasubize. Iyo nkoni uce uyirambika kuri wa mwana.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Ariko nyina w’uwo mwana abarira Elisa ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, sindagusiga.” Nuko Elisa ca ajana na we.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi arirukanga abagenda imbere, arambika ya nkoni kuri wa mwana, ariko umwana ntiyahema canke ngo yikakaze.<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Elisa ashitse muri iyo nzu, asanga umuvyimba wa wa mwana uryamye ku buriri bwiwe. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Aca arinjira, ariyugarana, hanyuma asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Aca yurira ku buriri, yubarara kuri wa mwana, umunwa wiwe uja ku munwa w’uwo mwana, amaso yiwe aja ku maso y’uwo mwana, ibiganza vyiwe na vyo bifatana n’ivy’uwo mwana. Akimwubarayeko, umubiri w’umwana utangura gususuruka. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisa aca arahaguruka, agendagenda muri ico cumba akanya gatoya, hanyuma asubira ku buriri yongera kumwubararako. Wa mwana aca yasamura incuro indwi, hanyuma aca arakanura.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Elisa aca ahamagara Gehazi, amubwira ati: “Hamagara wa Munyashunemukazi.” Elisa aramuhamagara. Ashitse Elisa amubwira ati: “Akira umwana wawe.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Arinjira yikubita ku birenge vya Elisa, yubama hasi. Aca atora wa mwana arasohoka.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa avura imboga zirimwo ubumara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Igihe kimwe Elisa asubira i Gilugali, kandi ico gihe hari inzara nyinshi. Umusi umwe abiga ibijanye n’ivyo kuvugishwa bari bakoraniye aho Elisa ari, na we abwira umukozi wiwe ati: “Fata inkono nini ushire ku ziko, utekere imboga aba bantu.”<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Umwe muri bo aca yirukanga mu gahinga gusoroma imboga, ahasanga umutangatanga awamurako imitangatanga, ayitekera mu mutamana wiwe. Agarutse, ayitemagurira muri ya nkono y’imboga, kuko batari bazi ivyo ari vyo. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Bamaze kwarura izo mboga bagatangura kurya, bakomera induru rimwe bati: “Muntu w’Imana, izi mboga zirimwo ishano.” Ntibashobora kuzirya.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Elisa aca avuga ati: “Nimunzanire agafu.” Aca agasuka muri ya nkono, avuga ati: “Nimuhereze abantu barye.” Nuko basanga nta shano rikiri muri iyo nkono.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa agaburira abantu ijana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Muri ico gihe haza umuntu azananye i Bayali-Shalisha, azaniye uwo muntu w’Imana imikate mirongo ibiri y’ingano zeze ubwa mbere, ayizanye mw’isaho yiwe, amuzanira n’udushishi tw’ingano nshasha. Elisa avuga ati: “Bigaburire abantu babirye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Umukozi wiwe amubaza ati: “Nogaburira nte utuntu tungana ukwo abantu ijana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Ariko Elisa amubwira ati: “Bihereze abandi barye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Bararya bongere basigaze.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Nuko arabibagaburira, bararya mbere haba n’ibisigara, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabivuze.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Namani akira imibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Hariho umugabo yitwa Namani, yari umukuru ahambaye w’ingabo z’umwami w’i Siriya. Yari afise icubahiro cinshi imbere y’umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yacishako intsinzi ya Siriya. Yari umusoda akomeye cane, ariko yari agwaye imibembe.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Abasoda ba Siriya bari barigeze gutera Isirayeli, hanyuma mu bantu bagize inyagano harimwo umukobwa w’Umwisirayelikazi, aca aba incoreke ya muka Namani. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Uwo mukobwa abwira inabuja ati: “Hamwe databuja yoja kuraba umuvugishwa n’Imana aba i Samariya, yomukiza irya mibembe.”<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Namani aja kuraba shebuja amubwira ivyo uwo mukobwa w’Umwisirayelikazi yamubwiye. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Umwami w’i Siriya amwishura ati: “Ni vyiza itegure, nanje nzorungikira ikete umwami wa Isirayeli.” Nuko agenda ajanye italanto icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 340.</char></note> z’ifeza, shekeli ibihumbi bitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 69.</char></note> z’inzahabu, n’imyambaro cumi y’impuzu. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Ikete yashiriye umwami wa Isirayeli ryarimwo ubu butumwa: “Umusavyi wanje Namani ndamurungikanye iri kete kugira ngo umuvure umukize imibembe.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Umwami wa Isirayeli akirisoma, aca yitabagurirako impuzu, avuga ati: “Mbega jewe nabaye Imana, ko ari yo ifise ububasha bwo kwica no gukiza abantu? Ni kubera iki amundungikiye ngo ndamuvure imibembe? Aha ntashaka aho ankura gusa kugira ngo asubire kudutera?”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Wa muntu w’Imana Elisa yumvise ko umwami yitaburiyeko impuzu, aca arungika intumwa kumubaza iti: “Ni kubera iki witaburiyeko impuzu? Ndungikira uwo muntu, azomenya ko muri Isirayeli hari umuvugishwa w’ukuri.” <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Maze Namani afata ifarasi yiwe n’umukogote wayo aragenda, ahagarara imbere y’umuryango w’inzu ya Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisa aca arungika intumwa, imubwira iti: “Genda woge muri Yorodani incuro indwi, umubiri wawe uraheza usubire uko wahora, ukire imibembe.”<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Maze Namani aca arashavura, arivumbura, avuga ati: “Namye niyumvira ko aza gusohoka akaza aho ndi, agahamagara izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, akazungagiza ikiganza hejuru y’aho ngwaye, hanyuma akankiza imibembe. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Mbega inzuzi Abana na Farupara z’i Damasiko, si zo nziza kuruta inzuzi zose zo muri Isirayeli? Sinari kuja kuzogamwo ngakira?” Namani aca asubira inyuma ashavuye cane.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Abagendanyi biwe baramukurikira, bamubwira bati: “Databuja, iyo uwo muvugishwa akubwira gukora ibikomeye kurusha ivyo ntiwari kubikora? None akubwiye ati: ‘Genda woge urakira,’ ntakubwiye ivyoroshe cane?” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Nuko aramanuka, yibira muri Yorodani incuro indwi, nk’uko wa muntu w’Imana yari yamubwiye, umubiri wiwe uca usubira kuba muzima, umera nk’uw’umwana mutoya.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Namani n’abari bamuherekeje baca basubira kwa wa muntu w’Imana. Ahagarara imbere yiwe aramubwira ati: “Noneho menye neza ko mw’isi yose ata yindi Mana ibaho atari muri Isirayeli. None rero ndakwinginze wakire ishikanwa ry’umusavyi wawe.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Wa muvugishwa aramubwira ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana nkorera, ko ntashobora kwakira ikintu na kimwe.” Namani agerageza kumwinginga ngo abimwakirire, ariko aranka.<verse eid="2KI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Namani amubwira ati: “Ko unyankiye, reka mpfume ntwara ivu rya hano ryotwarwa n’indogoba zibiri, kuko jewe umusavyi wawe ntazosubira gushikanira ikimazi gituriwe canke ngo nshikanire ishikanwa iyindi mana atari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambabarire kuri iki kimwe. Databuja niyinjira mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana Rimoni kucunamira, hanyuma akishimikiza ukuboko kwanje, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azombabarire ninunama.”<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisa amubwira ati: “Niwigire amahoro.”<verse eid="2KI 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Namani amaze kugenda urugendo rutari ruto, Gehazi umukozi wa Elisa umuntu w’Imana yibwira ati: “Databuja yorohereje cane uwu Musiriya, ntiyari akwiye kwanka kwakira ivyo yamuzaniye. Ndarahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, singenda ntamukurikiye ngo ngire ico ndamukuyeko.”<verse eid="2KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Nuko Gehazi aca yoma inyuma Namani. Namani abonye ko ariko araza amukurikira, aca yururuka umukogote, aja guhura na we, aramubaza ati: “Ni amahoro?”<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gehazi aramwishura ati: “Ni amahoro. Databuja antumye kukubwira ko hari babiri bo mu biga ibijanye no kuvugishwa bavuye mu mitumba yo mu ntara ya Efurayimu bamugendeye. None ngo bahe italanto imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 34.</char></note> y’ifeza n’imyambaro ibiri y’impuzu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Namani amubwira amwinginga ati: “Ahubwo nutware italanto zibiri.” Aca afata italanto zibiri azihambirira hamwe azishira mu mufuko, amuhana n’imyambaro ibiri y’impuzu, aca abiha abakozi biwe babiri ngo babitware bitangire imbere Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Bageze ku mpinga y’umusozi, Gehazi aca asaba ba bakozi za ngabire bari bazanye azinyegeza i muhira iwe, aca arabarungika basubira inyuma.<verse eid="2KI 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Asubiye kwa shebuja, aramubaza ati: “Uvuye he ga Gehazi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Gehazi yishura ati: “Umusavyi wawe nta na hamwe yari yaroye.”<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Ariko Elisa aramubaza ati: “Mbe ntuzi ko impwemu yanje yari harya igihe Namani yururuka umukogote wiwe aza guhura nawe? Mbega iki ni igihe co kwakira amahera, impuzu, imirima y’imyelayo n’iy’imizabibu, ibitungwa, n’abagurano? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Ko wakoze ivyo, imibembe ya Namani izokwomako wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe ibihe vyose.” Ako kanya nyene Gehazi aca ava imbere ya Elisa ajejeta imibembe, yera derere.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ishoka ireremba ku mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Umusi umwe, umugwi w’abavugishwa baja kuraba Elisa bamubwira bati: “Ehe raba aha hantu twama dukoranira na wewe ni hato cane ntitukihakwirwa. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Reka tumanuke kuri Yorodani, umwe wese azane igiti, maze twiyubakire inzu yo gukoraniramwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Elisa ababwira ati: “Egome, nimugende.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Umwe muri bo aramubaza ati: “None wewe ntujana n’abasavyi bawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Elisa ati: “Egome, turajana.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Nuko bamanuka kuri Yorodani, batangura kurondera ibiti vyo kwubaka.<verse eid="2KI 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Umwe muri bo ariko araca igiti, ishoka yiwe iraroka igwa mu mazi. Aca arasemerera ati: “Ndagowe mugenzi! Iyo shoka yari iyo natiye!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Wa muntu w’Imana aramubaza ati: “Yakorokeye he?” Ahamweretse, Elisa aca aca agashami k’igiti agaterera aho yakorokeye, ya shoka ica irareremba ku mazi. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Aramubwira ati: “Yitore.” Wa muntu aca atuma ukuboko arayitora.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa ahuma amaso abasoda baje kumutera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Igihe umwami w’i Siriya yariko aragwana na Isirayeli, yahora abwira abasoda biwe ati: “Nzoshira amakambi y’abasoda aha n’aha.”<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Maze uwo muntu w’Imana Elisa, agaca arungika intumwa ku mwami wa Isirayeli ati: “Uze wirinde ntuce mu kibanza iki n’iki, kuko abasoda b’umwami w’i Siriya ari ho bateguye gushinga ikambi yabo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Umwami wa Isirayeli na we agaca atohoza ivy’aho hantu uwo muntu w’Imana yavuze. Biba kenshi Elisa na we akama aburira umwami wa Isirayeli, kugira ngo yame agavye.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Ivyo bitera umwami w’i Siriya kuraka. Atumako abakuru mu ngabo ziwe zose ababaza ati: “Ni nde muri mwebwe amena amabanga? Ni nde abwira integuro zacu umwami wa Isirayeli?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Umwe muri abo bakuru amwishura ati: “Nta n’umwe muri twebwe mwami nyeningoma, ariko Elisa umuvugishwa wo muri Isirayeli, ni we abwira umwami wa Isirayeli n’ijambo uvugiye ku buriri uryamako.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Uwo mwami na we aca ababwira ati: “Genda mubaririkize aho ari kugira ndungike abasoda kumufata.” Maze baragaruka bamubwira bati: “Ari i Dotani.” <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Aca arungikayo imikogote n’amafarasi hamwe n’abasoda benshi, bagenda mw’ijoro, bakikuza igisagara.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Umukozi wa Elisa avyutse kare mu gatondo, arasohoka, abona abasoda benshi n’amafarasi n’imikogote, bakikuje igisagara. Wa mukozi arasemerera ati: “Karabaye databuja! Mbega tubigenza gute?”<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Wa muvugishwa amubwira ati: “Ntugire ubwoba. Abari kumwe natwe basumba abari kumwe na bo.”<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Elisa aca asenga avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ugurura amaso yiwe kugira ngo abone.” Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yugurura amaso y’uwo mukozi, yunamuye amaso abona imitumba yuzuye amafarasi n’imikogote y’umuriro bikikuje Elisa.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Abo bansi bakimanuka baza aho Elisa yari ari, aca arasenga avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, suka uruhumyi kuri abo bantu.” Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abasukako uruhumyi nk’uko Elisa abisavye.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Elisa aca ababwira ati: “Mwafashe inzira itari yo, kandi n’igisagara bababwiye si iki. Nimunkurikire ndabatware ku wo murondera.” Nuko aca abatwara i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Bamaze kwinjira mu gisagara, Elisa asenga avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ugurura amaso y’aba basoda kugira ngo babone.” <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abugurura amaso barabona, basanga bashitse hagati mu gisagara i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Umwami wa Isirayeli ababonye, abaza Elisa ati: “Data, ndabice? Uranyemereye ndabice?”<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Aramwishura ati: “Ntubice. Wokwicisha inkota canke umuheto abantu wafatishije amaboko? Ahubwo bahe ivyokurya ubahe n’amazi, barye hanyuma basubire kwa shebuja.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Nuko abategurira amazimano akomeye, bahejeje kurya no kunywa aca arabarungika basubira kwa shebuja. Kuva ico gihe, imigwi y’abasuma bo muri Siriya ntiyabaye igisubira kwinjira mu gihugu ca Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikigoyi gitera i Samariya kubera kwugarizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Haheze igihe, Beni-Hadadi umwami w’i Siriya akoranya ingabo ziwe zose, baja kwugariza Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Hatera inzara ikomeye mu gisagara, imara igihe kirekire gushika aho umutwe w’indogoba wagurwa shekeli mirongo umunani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 920.</char></note> z’ifeza, n’ica kane n’ingero kabu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 100.</char></note> y’amase y’inuma na yo kikagurwa shekeli zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 58.</char></note> z’ifeza.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Umusi umwe umwami wa Isirayeli yariko aragendagenda ku ruzitiro, yumva umugore asemerera avuga ati: “Ntabara se mwami nyeningoma!”<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Umwami amwishura ati: “Nimba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atagutabaye, jewe nokura he ico kugufashisha? Nta kintu na kimwe gisigaye. Ku mbuga yo gukubitirako ingano canke mu bwato bwo kuganiramwo umuvinyu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Ariko arongera amubaza ati: “Ufise ingorane nki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Na we amwishura ati: “Uyu mugore yambwiye ati: ‘Zana umuhungu wawe tumurye uwu musi, ejo na ho tuzorya uwanje.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Nuko uwiwanje turamuteka turamurya. Bukeye ndamubwira nti: ‘Zana umuhungu wawe na we tumurye.’ Ariko aca aramunyegeza.”<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Umwami yumvise amajambo y’uwo mugore, yitaburirako impuzu. Uko yagendagenda ku ruzitiro, abanyagisagara bose bamurabira hasi, bamubona yambaye igunira ryonyene. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Aravuga ati: “Imana ibimpanire, kandi bihambaye, uwu musi umutwe wa Elisa mwene Shafati niwarara ugifatanye n’ibitugu vyiwe.”<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Elisa yari yicaye i muhira iwe, ari kumwe n’abatware. Umwami aca arungika intumwa imbere yiwe, ariko bataranashika, Elisa abarira ba batware ati: “Murabona ingene uwu mwicanyi arungitse umuntu kunca umutwe! Niyashika muce mwugara umuryango, mumwugaranire hanze. Ibirenge vya shebuja ntimuvyumva inyuma yiwe?” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Akiriko arababwira ivyo, ya ntumwa iba irabashikiriye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:33">Umwami aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we aduteye aya magorwa yose. None noba nkimwitezeko iki?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisa aca avuga ati: “Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Ejo nk’aya mango, kw’irembo ry’i Samariya, ingero seya imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 5,5.</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza izogurwa shekeli imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 12.</char></note> n’ingero seya zibiri za sayiri zizogurwa shekeli imwe.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Umukuru w’ingabo umwami yagenda yishimikije yishura uwo muntu w’Imana ati: “Naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yokwugurura ingomero zo mw’ijuru, ivyo ntivyoshoboka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Elisa aca amubwira ati: “Uzobibona ariko ntuzobiryako!”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyabaye kw’irembo ry’i Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Kw’irembo ry’igisagara hariho abantu bane babaho bagwaye imibembe. Barabazanya bati: “Mbega ni kubera iki tuguma twicaye ngaha gushika aho twicwa n’inzara? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Nitwaja mu gisagara, hariyo inzara, izotwicirayo. Kandi nitwaguma ngaha, na ho nyene izotwica. Ehe rero nimuze tuje hariya kw’ikambi y’Abasiriya, twishikane. Nibatugirira imbabazi tuzobaho. Nayo nibatwica, n’ubu turapfuye.”<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Uwo mugoroba nyene bafata inzira baja kw’ikambi y’Abasiriya, basanga nta muntu n’umwe ahari. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Imana yari yatumye Abasiriya bumva urwamo rw’imikogote n’amafarasi hamwe n’abasoda benshi cane, bituma babwirana bati: “Erega noneho umwami wa Isirayeli yakoranije umwami w’Abaheti n’uwa Egiputa baza kudutera!” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Maze uwo mugoroba nyene bakura hasi barahunga, bata amahema yabo n’amafarasi n’indogoba zabo. Basiga ibintu vyabo vyose uko vyari biri, banyaga amagara.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Ba bantu bagwaye imibembe bashitse aho ayo mahema yabo atangurira, binjira mw’ihema rimwe. Bararya, baranywa, bongera batora inzahabu, ifeza n’impuzu, baja kubinyegeza. Baragaruka binjira mu rindi hema, batorayo ibindi, na vyo nyene baja kubinyegeza.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Hanyuma barabwirana bati: “Ariko ivyo turiko turakora si vyiza. Uwu ni umusi w’inkuru nziza, none turiko turawigungana. Nitwarindira bugaca, igihano kizotugwako. Reka tugende ubu nyene kubivuga i bwami.”<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Nuko baragenda bahamagara abarinzi b’irembo ry’igisagara, bababwira bati: “Twinjiye mw’ikambi y’Abasiriya, nta muntu n’umwe twasanzeyo, nta n’agakacira, atari indogoba n’amafarasi biziritse, amahema na yo bayataye uko yakabaye.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ba barinzi b’irembo ry’igisagara baca barasemerera bavuga iyo nkuru nziza, maze na yo ishikira abo ku kirimba c’umwami.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Umwami aca arahaguruka iryo joro nyene, abarira abatware biwe ati: “Reka ndababwire ico Abasiriya bagomba kudukorera. Barazi ko inzara itwishe, none bavuye mw’ikambi baja kwinyegeza mu gahinga, biteze ko tuva mu gisagara kugira ngo bace badufata hamwe n’igisagara.”<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Umwe mu bakuru b’ingabo avuga ati: “Reka turungike abantu bafata amafarasi atanu asigaye mu gisagara baje kuraba ivyo bintu. Nihagira ico baba, ni co kimwe n’aho boguma ngaha bagapfana n’Abisirayeli bose.”<verse eid="2KI 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Nuko baca bafata imikogote ibiri n’indogoba zayo, umwami arabarungika ngo bakurikire abasoda b’Abasiriya. Abwira abagendera kuri ayo mafarasi ati: “Genda murabe ivyabaye.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Nuko barabakurikirana gushika kuri Yorodani, basanga ibarabara ryuzuyemwo impuzu n’ibindi bikoresho Abasiriya bagiye barata mu nzira bahunga. Za ntumwa ziragaruka zibibwira umwami. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Maze abantu barasohoka, baja gusahura ivyo muri ya kambi y’Abasiriya. Ni ho ingero seya y’ifu inoze neza yagurwa shekeli imwe, n’ingero seya zibiri za sayiri zigurwa shekeli imwe, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabivuze.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Wa mukuru mu ngabo umwami yagenda yishimikije ashingwa igikorwa co gucungera uruja n’uruza kw’irembo, ariko aratemba kubera umusunikano w’abantu, na bo baramuhonyanga gushika apfuye, nk’uko wa muntu w’Imana yari yabivuze igihe umwami yari aje i muhira iwe. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Vyagenze nk’uko uwo muntu w’Imana yari yabibwiye umwami ati: “Ejo nk’aya mango, kw’irembo ry’i Samariya, ingero seya imwe y’ifu inoze neza izogurwa shekeli imwe n’ingero seya zibiri za sayiri zizogurwa shekeli imwe.”<verse eid="2KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Iyo ntwazangabo yari yabwiye uwo muntu w’Imana iti: “Naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yokwugurura ingomero zo mw’ijuru, ivyo ntivyoshoboka.” Uwo muntu w’Imana arababwira ati: “Uzobirabisha amaso yawe, ariko ntuzobiryako.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Kandi vyagenze uko nyene, kuko abantu bamuhonyangiye kw’irembo ry’igisagara aca arapfa.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Umunyashunemukazi asubizwa itongo ryiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Elisa yari yarabwiye wa mugore w’i Shunemu, nyina wa wa mwana yasubiza ubuzima, ati: “Raba iyo uja n’umuryango wawe muve ngaha mumareyo igihe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira ateze inzara izomara imyaka indwi muri Isirayeli.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Uwo mugore aca abikora nk’uko uwo muntu w’Imana yari yabimubwiye. Ahitana umuryango wiwe aja kuba mu guhugu c’Abafilisitiya, amarayo imyaka indwi.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Iyo myaka indwi iheze, aragaruka ava mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya, aja gusaba umwami inzu n’itongo. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Ashitse asanga umwami ariko aganira na Gehazi amubaza ati: “Mbwira ibintu bihambaye vyose Elisa yakoze.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Gehazi akiriko arabwira umwami ingene Elisa yasengeye umwana yapfuye akongera akaba muzima, uwo mugore nyina w’uwo mwana arashika, asaba umwami inzu hamwe n’itongo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Gehazi aca avuga ati: “Mwami wanje, uwo ni wa mugore nakubwira Elisa yasubiriza umwana ubuzima kandi na nya mwana ni uwu.”<verse eid="2KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Umwami aca amubaza ingene vyagenze na we arabimwiganira. Umwami aca ategeka umutware kumukurikiranira ibintu vyiwe no kubimusubiza, harimwo n’igiciro c’ivyo bimbuye vyose muri iryo tongo igihe atari ho ari.<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hazayeli yica Beni-Hadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Umusi umwe, Elisa aja i Damasiko, kandi ico gihe Beni-Hadadi, umwami w’i Siriya, yari agwaye. Haza umuntu amubwira ati: “Wa muntu w’Imana yashitse ino.” <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />Umwami avyumvise, abarira Hazayeli ati: “Tora amashikanwa uje kumusanganira, umubwire ambarize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko nzokira iyi ngwara.”<verse eid="2KI 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Hazayeli aja gusanganira Elisa atwaye amashikanwa agizwe n’ibintu vy’agaciro vy’i Damasiko, vyikorewe n’ingamiya mirongo ine. Aragenda ahagarara imbere yiwe amubwira ati: “Umusavyi wawe Beni-Hadadi, umwami w’i Siriya, andungitse kukubaza ko azokira ingwara agwaye.”<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Elisa amwishura ati: “Genda umubwire uti: ‘Uzokira.’ Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampishuriye ko azopfa.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Aca ahagarara imbere ya Hazayeli amuraba mu maso gushika aho yumva isoni. Uwo muntu w’Imana aca atangura kurira.<verse eid="2KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Hazayeli aramubaza ati: “Mbega nyakwubahwa ni iki gitumye urira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Na we amwishura ati: “Ni kubera nzi ivyago uzoteza Abisirayeli. Uzoturira ibisagara vyabo bizitiye, umarishe inkota imikangara yabo, ufyonyagure inzoya zabo, ufomoze n’inda abagore babo bibungenze.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazayeli aramubaza ati: “Mbega umusavyi wawe nkanje ata co amaze, nokora ibintu bihambaye gutyo nte?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Elisa amwishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanyeretse ko uzoba umwami w’i Siriya.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Hazayeli aca asiga Elisa aho, asubira kwa shebuja. Beni-Hadadi amubajije ati: “Elisa yakubwiye ngw’iki?” Na we amwishura ati: “Yambwiye ko ata nkeka, uzokira.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Ariko bukeye, Hazayeli afata uburengeti abuzinga incuro nyinshi, abwinika mu mazi, hanyuma abutsindagira mu maso h’umwami gushika acikanye. Hazayeli aca aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Mu mwaka ugira gatanu Yoramu mwene Ahabu ari umwami wa Isirayeli, ni ho Yehoramu mwene Yehoshafati umwami w’Abayuda, na we yaba umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Ico gihe yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu n’ibiri, amara imyaka umunani aganza ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Agendera mu ngeso z’abami b’Abisirayeli, nk’uko ab’inzu ya Ahabu bakora, kuko yarongoye umukobwa wa Ahabu. Akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Ariko kubera isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaragiraniye na Dawidi umusavyi wiwe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyashaka guherengeteza Ubuyuda. Yari yarasezeranye kugumizaho itara ryiwe n’uruvyaro rwiwe ibihe vyose.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Mu gihe Yehoramu yari ku ngoma, Abanyedomu bagarariza Abayuda biyimikira umwami wabo. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Maze Yoramu aca aja gutera i Zayiri ajanye n’imikogote yiwe yose. Abanyedomu baramukikuza, ariko mw’ijoro aravyuka arasohoka, yicira inzira muri bo aragenda, ingabo ziwe na zo zirahunga zisubira i muhira. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Kuva ico gihe Abanyedomu baca barikukira, bikura ku Buyuda gushika n’ubu. N’igisagara c’i Libuna na co nyene gica kiragarariza.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yoramu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyanditse mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Hanyuma Yoramu ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Ahaziya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri Yoramu mwene Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli ari ku ngoma, Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda ni ho yima nk’umwami. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahaziya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri igihe yaba umwami, aganza umwaka umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina yitwa Ataliya umwuzukuru wa Omuri umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Agendera mu ngeso z’ab’inzu ya Ahabu, akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko yari afitaniye ubucuti n’umuryango wa Ahabu.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ahaziya ajana na Yoramu mwene Ahabu kugwanya Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya i Ramoti Gileyadi, maze Abasiriya bakomeretsa Yoramu. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Nuko umwami Yoramu aca asubira i Yezireyeli kugira ngo akirireyo ibikomere Abasiriya bamukomerekereje i Ramoti igihe yariko aragwana na Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:29">Maze Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda aramanuka aja i Yezireyeli gusuhuza Yoramu mwene Ahabu kuko yari yarakomeretse.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yehu arobanurwa nk’umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Umusi umwe, Elisa ahamagara umwe mu bigishwa b’abavugishwa, amubarira ati: “Itegure utware aka gacupa k’amavuta ya Elayo i Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Niwashikayo urondere Yehu mwene Yehoshafati, umwuzukuru wa Nimushi. Uce umukura mu mugwi wa bagenziwe, umwihereranye mu cumba c’imbere mu nzu. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Uce ufata aka gacupa, umusukeko aya mavuta ya elayo ku mutwe, umubwire uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: Ndagutoranije ngo ube Umwami wa Isirayeli.’ Maze uheze uce wugurura umuryango wiruke, ukize amagara yawe!”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Maze uwo musore w’umuvugishwa aja i Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Ashitseyo, yegera aho abakuru b’ingabo bari, avuga ati: “Nyakwubahwa, ndafise ico ndakubwira!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Yehu aramubaza ati: “Ukeneye nde muri twebwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Na we amwishura ati: “Wewe nyene, nyakwubahwa!”<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Nuko Yehu arahaguruka yinjira mu nzu. Wa muvugishwa amusuka amavuta ku mutwe, avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ati: ‘Ndakurobanuje amavuta kugira ngo ube umwami w’ubwoko bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ari bwo Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Uzotikize umuryango wa shobuja Ahabu, kugira ngo mpore amaraso y’abasavyi banje b’abavugishwa n’ay’abandi basavyi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bose yasheshwe na Yezebeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Abo mu nzu ya Ahabu bose nzobatikiza. Icitwa umugabo cose muri Isirayeli, yaba umugurano canke uwidegemvya. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Umuryango wa Ahabu nzowugira nk’uwa Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, co kimwe n’umuryango wa Bayasha mwene Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Nayo Yezebeli nta n’uwuzomuhamba, kuko imbwa zizomurira aho azogwa i Yezireyeli.’ ” Wa muvugishwa aca yugurura umuryango ariruka.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Yehu asohotse agasubira muri bagenziwe, baramubaza bati: “Ni amahoro? Urya musazi yakuronderera iki?” Yehu arabishura ati: “Ntimuzi, bene barya ivyo bakunda kudebagura?”<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Na bo bamubwira bati: “Reka kutubesha, tubwire ivyo akubwiye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Maze abishura ati: “Ambariye ati: ‘Ndagusize amavuta ngo ndagutoranye ube umwami wa Isirayeli.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Ubwo nyene baca bakura imitamana yabo barayimusasira aho yari ahagaze ku ngazi z’amabuye, bavuza inzamba, basemerera bati: “Umwami Yehu naganze!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu yica Yoramu na Ahaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Nuko Yehu mwene Yehoshafati akaba n’umwuzukuru wa Nimushi, ategura umugambi wo kwica Yoramu. Imbere y’aho, Yoramu yari amaze imisi ku rugamba i Ramoti Gileyadi agwanya Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Ariko yari yagarutse i Yezireyeli kwivuza ibikomere yakomerekejwe n’Abasiriya igihe yari ku rugamba. Yehu abwira abo bari kumwe ati: “Nimba mugomba ko mba umwami wanyu, nimucungere kino gisagara kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe asohoka ngo aje kuvuga inkuru y’ivyabaye i Yezireyeli.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Maze aca yurira umukogote wiwe, aja i Yezireyeli, kuko Yoramu ari yo yari aruhukiye kandi na Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda na we yari yamanutseyo kumusuhuza.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Umuraririzi yari ku munara w’i Yezireyeli abonye Yehu n’abasoda biwe begereje, arasemerera ahamagara Yoramu, amubwira ati: “Ndabona abasoda baje hano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Yoramu amubwira ati: “Rungika umusoda umwe afate ifarasi, agende abategere, ababaze ati: ‘Mugenzwa n’amahoro?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Wa musoda agendera kw’ifarasi ahura na Yehu aramubaza ati: “Umwami antumye kubabaza ko mugenzwa n’amahoro.” Yehu amwishura ati: “Ivyo vy’amahoro wewe ubishakako iki? Herera inyuma yanje, nta kindi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Wa muraririzi abwira umwami ati: “Umuntu twatumye yabashikiriye ariko ntiyagarutse.”<verse eid="2KI 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Yoramu atuma uwugira kabiri agendera kw’ifarasi. Na we abashikiriye ababwira ati: “Umwami antumye kubabaza ko mugenzwa n’amahoro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Yehu amwishura ati: “Ivyo vy’amahoro wewe ubishakako iki? Herera inyuma yanje, nta kindi.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Wa muraririzi aravuga ati: “Yabashikiriye, ariko na we nyene ntiyagarutse. Mbona umuntu ategerezwa kuba ari Yehu mwuzukuru wa Nimushi, ni we atwara ifarasi nk’umusazi.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Yoramu aca avuga ati: “Nimuntegurire umukogote ningoga.” Bamaze kuwutegura, Yoramu umwami wa Isirayeli na Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda baca baragenda, umwe wese mu mukogote wiwe, baja gutegera Yehu. Bahurira mw’itongo ryahora ari irya Naboti w’i Yezireyeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Yoramu ashikiriye Yehu, aramubaza ati: “Ugenzwa n’amahoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Yehu aramwishura ati: “Nogenzwa n’amahoro gute kandi ugusenga ibigirwamana n’ubupfumu vya nyoko Yezebeli vyuzuye muri twebwe?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Yoramu aca arahindukira ngo ahunge, agenda arasemerera ati: “Ahaziya we, ukampinduka!”<verse eid="2KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Yehu aca afata umuheto wiwe arasa Yoramu mu mugongo, umwampi umutobekeranya mu mutima, aca agwa mu mukogote aracikana. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Yehu aca abarira Bidikari uwatwara umukogote wiwe ati: “Mutore uje kumuterera mu murima wahoze ari uwa Naboti w’i Yezireyeli. Uribuka ko twe nawe twari mu mukogote umwe inyuma ya se wiwe Ahabu igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuga ivyiwe <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />ati: ‘Ndarahiye icese ko nzohorera amaraso ya Naboti n’ay’abahungu biwe, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mvuze, kandi ko muri iri tongo nyene ari ho nzobahorera, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mvuze.’ None rero mutware umuterere muri iryo tongo nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryavuze.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda abonye ibibaye, aca afata ibarabara rija i Beti-Hagani, arahunga. Yehu aramukurikira avuga ati: “Murase na we nyene!” Bamukomerekereza mu mukogote wiwe hafi ya Ibileyamu ariko araduga i Guri, ariko arabasiga aja i Megido, agwayo. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Abasavyi biwe baca bamushira mu mukogote bamutwara i Yerusalemu, bamuhamba hamwe na ba sekuruza, mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Ahaziya yari yabaye umwami w’i Buyuda mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri Yoramu mwene Ahabu ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezebeli yicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Hanyuma Yehu aja i Yezireyeli. Yezebeli avyumvise, yisiga agahama ku maso, arisokoza umushatsi, aca yicara araba mw’idirisha. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Abonye Yehu yinjiye mw’irembo aramubaza ati: “Uzanywe n’iki ga wa mwicanyi we? Umeze nka Zimuri yishe shebuja!”<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu yunamurira amaso kuri rya dirisha, avuga ati: “Ni nde ari ku ruhande rwanje? Ni nde?” Inkone zibiri canke zitatu zimurunguruka ziri mw’idirisha. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Yehu azibarira ati: “Mukororere hasi!” Na zo zica zimukororera hasi, arasaba, amaraso yiwe atarukira ku mpome, Yehu na we amuhonyangisha ifarasi.<verse eid="2KI 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Yehu yinjira mu nzu, ararya, aranywa. Aca avuga ati: “Nihagire uwufata uwo mugore w’ikivume amuhambe, kuko yari umukobwa w’umwami.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Ariko basohotse ngo baje kumuhamba, basanga hasigaye agahanga hamwe n’amaguru n’amaboko. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Baca basubira inyuma babibwira Yehu, na we avuga ati: “Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rishitse, iryavuzwe n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Eliya w’i Tishubi, aho yavuga ati: ‘Mw’itongo ry’i Yezireyeli ni ho imbwa zizorira umuvyimba wa Yezebeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Umuvyimba wa Yezebeli uzosanzara nk’umwavu mw’itongo ry’i Yezireyeli, kugira ngo ntihazogire n’uwoshobora kuvuga ati: Uwu ni Yezebeli.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Umuryango wa Ahabu wicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Ahabu yari afise abahungu mirongo indwi baba i Samariya. Maze Yehu yandika amakete ayarungika i Samariya ku bakuru b’igisagara, ku batware no ku bacungera abana ba Ahabu. Yanditse avuga ati: <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Abahungu b’umwami bari kumwe namwe, kandi mufise imikogote, amafarasi igisagara kizitiye, hamwe n’ibigwanisho. None rero nimwabona iri kete, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />muce mutoranya mu bahungu ba Ahabu uwubereye kuba umwami wanyu, muheze mwitegurire kugwanira umuryango wa Ahabu.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Ariko baterwa n’ubwoba, bavuga bati: “Nimba abami babiri batashoboye kugwanya uwu Yehu, twebwe twoshobora kumugwanya dute?”<verse eid="2KI 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Nuko uwujejwe ikirimba ari kumwe n’umukuru w’igisagara hamwe n’abatware n’abacungera abana ba Ahabu barungikira ubutumwa Yehu bavuga bati: “Turi abasavyi bawe, tuzokora ivyo uzotubwira vyose, nta mwami twimika, nukore ivyo ubona bibereye vyose.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Yehu aca abarungikira amakete ubwa kabiri avuga ati: “Nimba muri ku ruhande rwanje mukiyemeza kunyubaha, Nimuce imitwe abahungu ba shobuja, muzoyinsanze i Yezireyeli ejo nk’aya mango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Ico gihe abo bana b’umwami uko bari mirongo indwi bari kumwe n’abatware b’igisagara babaha indero y’i bwami. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ayo makete abashikiriye, baca bafata ba bana b’umwami babaca imitwe bose uko ari mirongo indwi. Bashira imitwe yabo mu biseke, bayirungikira Yehu i Yezireyeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Intumwa iragenda ibarira Yehu iti: “Bazanye imitwe ya ba bana b’umwami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Yehu na we aca ategeka ati: “Nimuyirunde mu bwinjiriro bw’igisagara, muyigumizeho gushika ejo mu gitondo.”<verse eid="2KI 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Bukeye mu gatondo Yehu arasohoka, ahagarara imbere y’ikoraniro avuga ati: “Mwebwe nta caha mufise. Ni jewe nateguye kwica databuja Yoramu nongera ndabishitsa. Ariko aba bobo bishwe na nde? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Nimumenye ko ata jambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze ku muryango wa Ahabu ritazoshika. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashikije ivyo yavuze aciye ku musavyi wiwe Eliya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Hanyuma Yehu yica abo mu muryango wa Ahabu bose bari basigaye i Yezireyeli, hamwe n’abatware biwe bari bahambaye, abagenzi biwe n’abaherezi biwe, ntiyasigaza n’umwe.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Yehu aca arahaguruka aja i Samariya. Akiri mu nzira, ageze i Beti-Ekedi h’Abungere, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />ahura na bamwe bo mu ncuti za Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda, arababaza ati: “Muri ba nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">Na bo bamwishura bati: “Turi incuti za Ahaziya, tugiye kuramutsa abahungu b’umwami Ahaziya hamwe n’umugabekazi.”<verse eid="2KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Yehu aca atanga itegeko ati: “Bafatishe amaboko!” Baca barabafata babicira i ruhande y’iriba ry’i Beti-Ekedi. Abishwe bari abagabo mirongo ine na babiri. Ntiyasigaje n’uwo kuvuga inkuru.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Avuye aho aca ahura na Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu, yari aje kumutegera. Yehu aramuramutsa, amubaza ati: “Mbega uranyoboka nk’uko nanje ndakuyoboka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Yehonadabu yishura ati: “Ego cane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Yehu amubwira ati: “Niwaba unyoboka, mpa ukuboko kwawe.” Yehonadabu amuha ukuboko, na we amwuriza mu mukogote wiwe. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Yehu amubwira ati: “Ingo tujane, wirabire ishaka mfitiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Nuko bajana muri uwo mukogote.<verse eid="2KI 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Yehu ashitse i Samariya, yica abari basigaye mu muryango wa Ahabu bose, arabatikiza nk’uko ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabwiye Eliya ryabivuze.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakorera Bayali bicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Yehu akoranya abantu bose ababwira ati: “Ahabu yakoreye Bayali mu ntege nke, jewe Yehu nzoyikorera n’inkomezi nyinshi. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Nimunzanire abavugishwa ba Bayali, abakozi bayo hamwe n’abaherezi bayo bose. Murabe neza ntihagire n’umwe musiga inyuma kuko ngira mpereze Bayali ikimazi gihambaye. Uwutazoba yaje wese azokwicwa.” Ariko Yehu yari afise umugambi wo kurandura abakorera Bayali bose.<verse eid="2KI 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yehu avuga ati: “Nimutumeko ikoraniro mw’izina rya Bayali.” Nuko baritumako. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Arungika intumwa ku bakozi ba Bayali mu gihugu cose ca Isirayeli kugira ngo baze, ntihagira n’umwe asigara inyuma. Ingoro ya Bayali yuzura abantu, uhereye imbere ugashitsa inyuma. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Yehu abwira uwari ajejwe kubika amakanzu ati: “Zanira amakanzu abakozi ba Bayali bose bambare.” Nuko arayabazanira.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Yehu na Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu binjira mu ngoro ya Bayali, Yehu abarira abakozi ba Bayali ati: “Musuzume neza ntihagire umukozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yoba ari muri mwebwe, hagume abakozi ba Bayali gusa.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Nuko batangura gutanga ibimazi baturira n’ibimota neza. Ariko Yehu yari yasize hanze abasoda mirongo umunani abihanikirije ati: “Hakagira umuntu n’umwe abatoroka akagenda, ni mwebwe muca mwicwa mu gishingo ciwe.”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Yehu agiheza guturira ibimota neza, aca ategeka abasoda biwe ati: “Nimwinjire mubice bose, ntihagire n’umwe abacika.” Bahejeje kubicisha inkota, abakuru n’abasanzi b’iyo ngoro ya Bayali baca basohora ibiziga vyabo babita hanze, binjira mu vyumba vyo hagati rwose muri iyo ngoro. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Basohora inkingi yari muri iyo ngoro, iyo bashikanirako ibimazi, barayiturira. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Bamenagura inkingi z’amabuye za Bayali basambura n’ingoro, ihinduka inzu yo kwihagarikamwo y’abantu bose gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Uko ni kwo Yehu yakuyeho ugusenga Bayali muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Ariko ntiyavuye mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakwegeyemwo n’Abisirayeli mu gusenga ibigirwamana vy’impfizi z’inka bicuzwe mu nzahabu, icari i Beteli n’icari i Dani.<verse eid="2KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yehu ati: “Ko wagize neza mu gukora ibibereye mu nyonga zanje, ugashitsa ivyo nipfuza gukorera ab’inzu ya Ahabu hamwe n’ibindi vyose nipfuza gukora, uruvyaro rwawe ruzokwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami bwa Isirayeli gushika ku runganwe rugira kane.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Ariko Yehu ntiyitaho gukurikiza Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli n’umutima wiwe wose. Ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu, ivyo yakwegeyemwo n’Abisirayeli bakabikora.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Kuva ico gihe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atangura kugabanya ubunini bwa Isirayeli. Hazayeli atangura kwigarurira ibice bimwebimwe vyo mu gihugu ca Isirayeli, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />ubuseruko bwa Yorodani harimwo Gileyadi mu ntara ya Gadi, Reyubeni na Manase, kuva Aroweri hafi y’akagezi Arunoni ugashitsa i Gileyadi n’i Bashani.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehu, ivyo yakoze n’ivyo yashitseko, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Yehu ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Samariya, umuhungu wiwe Yehowahazi aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Imyaka Yehu yamaze atwarira i Samariya yabaye mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ataliya na Yowashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Ataliya nyina wa Ahaziya abonye ko umuhungu wiwe apfuye, arahaguruka ngo atikize umuryango w’umwami wose. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Ariko Yehosheba umukobwa w’umwami Yoramu akaba na mushiki wa Ahaziya, aca afata Yowashi mwene Ahaziya aramunyuruza, amukuye mu bandi bana b’umwami bagira bicwe, amunyegeza mu cumba co kuryamamwo ari kumwe n’umurezi wiwe, kugira ngo amuhishe Ataliya, uko ni ko yarokotse. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Yowashi n’umurezi wiwe bamara imyaka itandatu banyegejwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gihe Ataliya ari we yatwara ico gihugu.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Mu mwaka ugira indwi, Yehoyada umuherezi atumako intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana, abo mu Bakariti, n’abarinzi bo ku kirimba, abajana mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Agiriranira isezerano na bo, aranabarahiza bari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Hanyuma, aca abereka wa mwana w’umwami. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Yehoyada ababwira ati: “Ibi ni vyo mukwiye gukora: mwebwe abari mu migwi itatu izoba iramukiwe gukora kw’Isabato, umugwi wa mbere uzocungera ikirimba c’umwami, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />umugwi wa kabiri ucungere Irembo rya Suri, uwa gatatu na wo uhagarare inyuma y’abacunze ikirimba. Iyo migwi yose uko ari itatu izoza irakuranwa mu gucungera ingoro. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Namwe abari mu yindi migwi ibiri itazoba ifise ibikorwa vyo kw’Isabato, muzocungera umwami mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Muzohagarare mukikuje umwami, mufise ibigwanisho mu maboko yanyu. Nihagira uwegera aho muri azokwicwe. Muzogume hafi y’umwami aho azoja hose.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Izo ntwazangabo zirongoye ingabo ijanijana zibikora nk’uko Yehoyada umuherezi yabibabwiye. Umwe wese ahitana abantu biwe, baba abari baramukiwe kuja ku bikorwa vyo kw’Isabato, canke abari bagombowe, bose babazana imbere ya Yehoyada umuherezi. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Na we abaha amacumu n’inkinzo vyari ivy’umwami Dawidi, vyari vyabitswe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Za ngabo, umwe wese afise ikigwanisho mu minwe, zikikuza umwami; hafi y’igicaniro n’Ingoro, kuva mu bumanuko ukaja mu buraruko bw’Ingoro.<verse eid="2KI 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Yehoyada aca asohokana umwana w’umwami amwambika urugori, amushikiriza n’ikopi y’ivyagezwe vy’Uhoraho, maze amenyesha ko abaye umwami. Bamusukako amavuta mu kumwimika, abari ngaho bose bakomera amashi rimwe, bavuga bati: “Umwami nahangame!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Maze Ataliya yumvise urwamo rw’ingabo n’abandi bantu, aca aja iyo bari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Aravye, abona umwami, ahagaze hafi y’inkingi nk’uko umugenzo wari uri. Intwazangabo n’abavuza inzamba bari i ruhande yiwe, abantu bose bo mu gihugu bariko baranezerwa bavuza inzamba. Maze Ataliya yitaburirako impuzu arasemerera ati: “Uwo ni umugararizo! Uwo ni umugararizo!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Umuherezi Yehoyada aca abwira intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana ati: “Nimumusohore hanze mumucishe hagati y’imirongo y’ingabo kandi mwicishe inkota uwomukurikira wese,” kuko yari yavuze ati: “Ntiyicirwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Nuko baramufata bamucisha mw’irembo ry’amafarasi rija ku mbuga y’ingoro y’umwami, bamwiciraho.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Yehoyada aca agiriranira isezerano n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’umwami n’abantu, ko bazoba abantu b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Yongera ashiraho isezerano hagati y’umwami n’abantu. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Abantu bose b’ico gihugu baca baja ku ngoro ya Bayali barayisenyagura. Basitagura ibicaniro n’ibigirwamana bicika ivu, bafata Matani umuherezi wa Bayali, bamwicira imbere y’ibicaniro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Maze umuherezi Yehoyada agena abantu bacungera Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Hanyuma ahitana za ntwazangabo z’abasoda ijanijana, ba bacangero b’Abakariti, abacungera ikirimba hamwe n’abantu bose bo muri ico gihugu, bakura umwami mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bamutwara ku kirimba, yinjirana irembo ryarimwo abasoda bamucungera. Umwami abona kwicara mu kibanza ciwe ku ntebe y’ubwami. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Abari aho bose bagira umunezero, n’igisagara kiba amahoro kuko Ataliya yari yamaze kwicishwa inkota muri ico kirimba.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yehowashi yari afise imyaka indwi igihe yaba umwami.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yowashi asanura Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Mu mwaka ugira indwi Yehu ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli ni ho Yowashi yaba umwami w’i Buyuda, aganza imyaka mirongo ine ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina yitwa Zibiya, yava i Berisheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yehowashi yakoze ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe mu myaka yose yamaze amenyerezwa n’umuherezi Yehoyada. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Ariko na we nyene ntiyashoboye gukuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi; abantu babandanije gushikanirayo ibimazi no gutuririraho ibimota neza.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Umusi umwe, Yowashi abarira abaherezi ati: “Nimwegeranye amahera yashikaniwe Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yaba ayashikanwa n’abaharuwe bose, ayo abantu biyemeje nk’isezerano canke ayo bashikana bavyishakiye. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Hanyuma umuherezi wese yakire kuri ayo mahera, ayakoreshe ivyo abona ko bikwiye gusanurwa ku Ngoro.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Ariko mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri na gatatu Yowashi ari ku ngoma, abo baherezi ntibari bwasanure Ingoro. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Nuko Yowashi atumako umuherezi mukuru ari we Yehoyada hamwe n’abandi baherezi ababaza ati: “Ni kubera iki mutarasanura Ingoro? Ntimuze mwongere gukoresha amahera mu vyo mukeneye. Kuva ubu amahera yose ategerezwa gukoreshwa ku vyo gusanura Ingoro gusa.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Ba baherezi baca bemera ko batazosubira gutoza amahera mu bantu, kandi ko atari bo ubwabo bazokurikirana ibikorwa vyo gusanura Ingoro.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Yehoyada aca afata isandugu ayicako intoboro ku mupfundikizo, ayitereka i ruhande y’igicaniro, ku ruhande rw’i buryo iyo umuntu ariko arinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Abaherezi barinda urwinjiriro rw’urusengro bakaja barayishiramwo amahera yose atanzwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Igihe cose babona ko amashikanwa yabaye menshi muri ya sandugu, umwanditsi w’umwami ari kumwe n’umuherezi mukuru baca baza, bagaharura amahera yaba yatanzwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bakayashira mu mifuko. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Amahera bategekanije akwiye baciye bayaha abashinzwe gukurikirana ibikorwa vy’ingoro. Ni yo bakoresheje mu guhemba abakoze ibikorwa vyo gusanura Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abasakara, ababaji, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />abubaka impome n’ababaza amabuye. Baragura imbaho, bakabazisha amabuye kugira ngo basanure Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bagatanga n’amahera yose yari akenewe ku gikorwa cose kijanye no gusanura iyo Ngoro.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Amahera yatanzwe ntiyakoreshejwe mu gucurisha amabesani, ibikombe canke ibindi bikoresho vyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bicuzwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Yose yakoreshejwe mu guhemba abakoze ibikorwa vyo gusanura Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Ntibigeze banasaba abo bahaye ayo mahera ngo babereke ingene yakoreshejwe kuko vyaragaragara ko bayakoresheje mu bwizigirwa bwose. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Amahera yatangwa n’abantu nk’impongano y’ivyaha ntiyajanwa muri ya sandugu yo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Yari yagenewe abaherezi.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Muri ico gihe ni ho Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya yaduga gutera i Gati, arahigarurira. Mu nyuma y’aho aca aja gutera i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Ariko Yowashi umwami w’i Buyuda aca afata ivy’agaciro vyose vyari vyareguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyatanzwe na Yehoshafati, Yehoramu na Ahaziya, ari bo bami batwaye imbere yiwe, afata n’ivyo we ubwiwe yari yareguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, n’inzahabu zose zari mu bubiko bw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu kirimba c’umwami, abirungikira Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya, na we abona gusubira inyuma, ntiyatera Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yowashi, hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose, vyaditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Mu nyuma abatware biwe bamugira inama, bamwicira i Beti-Milo, kw’ibarabara rija i Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Abatware bamwicishije bari Yozabadi mwene Shimeyati na Yehozabadi mwene Shomeri. Bompi bari abahanuzi biwe b’abizigirwa. Bamuhamba hamwe na ba sekuru mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Amaziya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehowahazi umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri na gatatu Yowashi mwene Ahaziya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Yehowahazi mwene Yehu yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, amara imyaka cumi n’indwi atwarira i Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze yongera abikwegeramwo Abisirayeli, kandi ntiyigeze abivamwo. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Maze uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringira Isirayeli, bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yemera ko bamara imyaka myinshi batwazwa igitugu na Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya, hamwe na Beni-Hadadi umuhugu wiwe.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Mu nyuma Yehowahazi arondera mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we aramwumvira, kuko yari yabonye ingene umwami w’i Siriya yashize Isirayeli mu gacinyizo gateye ubwoba. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arokora Abisirayeli, bava musi y’ubutegetsi bwa Siriya. Abisirayeli basubira kuba amahoro mu vyabo nk’uko vyahora. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Ariko na ho nyene ntibava mu vyaha vy’abo mu muryango wa Yerobowamu, ivyo yakoze akongera akabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli, na bo babandanya muri vyo, ntibakura n’inkingi ya Ashera yari ihagaze i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Ico gihe, ingabo za Yehowahazi zari zisigaye ari ubusa, kuko yari asigaranye amafarasi mirongo itanu, imikogote cumi n’abasoda ibihumbi cumi gusa. Umwami w’i Siriya yari yaratikije ayandi mafarasi n’imikogote hamwe n’abandi basoda, abigira nk’umukungugu wo ku mbuga.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehowahazi, n’ibindi vyose yakoze hamwe n’ivyo yashitseko vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Mu nyuma Yehowahazi ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Samariya. Umuhungu wiwe Yehowasi aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehowasi umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’indwi Yowashi ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, ni ho Yehowashi mwene Yehowahazi yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwarira i Samariya imyaka cumi n’itandatu. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze akongera akabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli, na bo bakabandanya babikora.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yowashi, ivyo yakoze vyose n’ivyo yashitseko, birimwo n’intambara yagwanye na Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku bami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yowashi ahambije ba sekuruza, Yerobowamu aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma, na we ahambwa i Samariya hamwe n’abandi bami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Igihe Elisa yari amaze kugwara cane, ingwara yahavuye imuviramwo urupfu, umwami Yowashi wa Isirayeli yagiye kumusuhuza, aramuririra ati: “Data, data! Wewe wabereye Abisirayeli imikogote n’abagendera ku mafarasi!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisa amubwira ati: “Akira umuheto n’imyampi.” Na we aravyakira. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Yongera amubwira ati: “Fata umuheto mu maboko yawe.” Amaze kuwufata, Elisha na we aca afatisha amaboko yiwe ku maboko y’umwami.<verse eid="2KI 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Elisa amubwira ati: “Ugurura idirisha ritumbereye mu buseruko.” Umwami araryugurura. Amubwira ati: “Rasa!” Na we ararasa. Elisa aca avuga ati: “Uwo ni umwampi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> urimwo intsinzi kuri Siriya. Abasiriya uzobatikiza ubamarire muri Efeki.”<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Yongera kumubwira ati: “Fata imyampi.” Umwami arayifata. Elisa amubwira ati: “Yirase hasi.” Umwami arasa hasi incuro zitatu hanyuma ageza aho. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Wa muntu w’Imana aca araraka ati: “Wari kurasa nk’incuro zitanu canke zitandandu. Ni ho wonesheje Aramu ukahatikiza. Ariko noneho uzohanesha incuro zitatu gusa.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Elisa arapfa, arahambwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Kandi igihe cose iyo umwaka ugeze aho imvura igomba gucika hama hariho imigwi y’abasuma bava i Mowabu bakinjira muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Umusi umwe hari Abisirayeli bariko barahamba umuntu, maze baja babona umugwi w’abasuma, baca baterera ikiziga ca wa muntu mu mva ya Elisa. Ca kiziga gikoze ku magufa ya Elisa, uwo muntu aca asubira kuba muzima, arahagarara.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya acinyiza Abisirayeli mu gihe cose Yehowahazi yamaze ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abagirira ubuntu n’imbabazi, arabitaho kubera isezerano yasezeraniye Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Gushika n’ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyigeze abatikiza ngo abamare, canke ngo abirukanire kure yiwe.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya apfuye, umuhungu wiwe Beni-Hadadi aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ni ho Yehowashi mwene Yehowahazi yaka Beni-Hadadi mwene Hazayeli ibisagara vyari vyarafashwe ku ngoma ya se Yehowahazi. Yehowasi anesha Beni-Hadadi incuro zitatu, abona kwigarurira ibisagara vyose vyari vyaranyazwe.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Mu mwaka ugira kabiri Yowahazi mwene Yehowahazi ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli, ni ho Amaziya mwene Yowashi yatangura kuganza i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’icenda ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yehoyadini, w’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, ariko ntiyashikira sekuruza Dawidi. Muri vyose yakurikiye ingeso za se Yowashi. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Amaziya ntiyashoboye gukuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi; abantu babandanije gushikanirayo ibimazi no gutuririraho ibimota neza.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Amaze gukomeza ubwami bwiwe, aca afata abatware bishe umwami ari we se arabica. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Ariko ntiyica abana b’abo bicanyi, kuko yubashe ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose rivuga riti: “Ntihaze hagire umuvyeyi yicwa azira abana biwe, canke abana ngo bicwe bazira abavyeyi babo, umwe wese azozire ivyaha vyiwe.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amaziya ni we yaneshereje abasoda ibihumbi cumi vy’Abanyedomu mu Kiyaya c’Umunyu. Ni na we yigaruriye Sela ayita Yokiteyeli, haracitwa gutyo gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Umusi umwe Amaziya arungikira intumwa Yehowashi mwene Yehowahazi, Yehowahazi mwene Yehu umwami wa Isirayeli, amubwira ati: “Ingo duhure, tugwane imbonankubone!”<verse eid="2KI 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Ariko Yehowashi umwami wa Isirayeli yishura Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda ati: “Muri Libani habaye igitovu, kibwira isederi ry’i Libani kiti: ‘Mpa umukobwa wawe abe umugore w’umuhungu wanje.’ Ariko haca haza igikoko kinini gihonyanga ca gitovu. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Ego data waranesheje Edomu none wuzuye ubwibone! Nezererwa intsinzi yawe hanyuma ugume iwawe. Ni kubera iki wikwegera amakuba, ukayakwegera n’Ubuyuda bwose?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Ariko Amaziya ntiyamwumvira, maze Yehowashi umwami wa Isirayeli aratera. We na Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda bahanganira i Beti-Shemeshi mu Buyuda, bagwana imbonankubone. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Abayuda baneshwa n’Abisirayeli, umusoda wese ahunga ataha i muhira iwe. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yehowashi umwami wa Isirayeli acakira Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda mwene Yowashi, Yowashi mwene Ahaziya, amufatira ahitwa Beti-Shemeshi. Maze Yehowashi aca aja i Yerusalemu, asenyurira hasi uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu uhereye kw’Irembo rya Efurayimu ugashitsa kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka, ahantu hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 180.</char></note>. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Asahura inzahabu n’ifeza n’ibindi bikoresho vyose vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’ubutunzi bwose bwari mu ngoro y’umwami. Afata n’abantu abagira inyagano, hanyuma asubira i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehowashi, ivyo yakoze hamwe n’ivyo yashitseko, harimwo n’intambara yagwanye na Amaziya, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehowashi amaze gupfa, ahambwa hamwe na ba sekuruza i Samariya. Umuhungu wiwe Yerobowamu aca aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Amaziya mwene Yowashi umwami w’i Buyuda yamaze imyaka cumi n’itanu inyuma y’urupfu rwa Yehowashi mwene Yehowahazi umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Amaziya, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda?<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Maze ab’i Yerusalemu bagira inama yo kumwica, na we aca arahunga aja i Lakishi, ariko barungika abantu bamusanga i Lakishi bamutsindayo. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Bamugarukana i Yerusalemu kw’ifarasi, bamuhamba hamwe na ba sekuruza mu Gisagara ca Dawidi.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Maze abantu bose b’i Buyuda bahitamwo Uziya, yari afise imyaka cumi n’itandatu, aba ari we bagira umwami mu gishingo ca se Azariya. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Inyuma y’urupfu rwa se, Uziya ni we yasubiriye kwubaka igisagara ca Elati, agisubiza ku Buyuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yerobowamu wa Kabiri, umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi na gatanu Amaziya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, Yerobowamu mwene Yowashi umwami wa Isirayeli ni ho yaza i Samariya atwarirayo imyaka mirongo ine n’umwe. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze yongera abikwegeramwo Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Ni we yasubijeho imbibe za Isirayeli, kuva i Lebo-Hamati gushika ku kiyaga ca Araba, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli yabivugishije umusavyi wiwe Yona mwene Amitayi, umuvugishwa yava i Gati-Heferi.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabonye amakuba n’imibabaro Abisirayeli barimwo, baba abagurano canke abidegemvya, ata kibatabara. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atari yarigeze avuga ko azohanagura izina rya Isirayeli kw’isi, abakirisha ukuboko kwa Yerobowamu mwene Yowashi.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yerobowamu, ibijanye n’ukuntu yakomeje igisoda ciwe, intambara yagwanye, n’ingene yagarukanye ibisagara vya Damasiko na Hamati kuri Isirayeli, ibisagara vyari vyarigaruriwe na Yuda, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yerobowamu arahava ahamvya ba sekuruza, ari bo bami ba Isirayeli. Umuhungu wiwe Zakariya aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Uziya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi Yerobowamu umwami wa Isirayeli ari ku ngoma, Azariya mwene Amaziya ni ho yaba umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Ico gihe yari afise imyaka cumi n’itandatu, hanyuma aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yekoliya, w’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Amaziya yakora. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Ariko ntiyashoboye gukuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi; abantu babandanije gushikanirayo ibimazi no gutuririraho ibimota neza.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ateza imibembe umwami gushika ku musi yapfiriyeko, kandi yaba mu kazu ka wenyene. Yotamu umwana w’umwami aca aba ari we azezwa ikirimba, yongera atwara abantu bo muri ico gihugu.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Azariya hamwe n’ibindi vyose yakoze, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Azariya arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Yotamu aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Zakariya umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’umunani Azariya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, ni ho Zakariya mwene Yerobowamu yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwarira i Samariya amezi atandatu. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko abatwaye imbere yiwe babikoze. Ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze akanabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Hanyuma Shalumu mwene Yabeshi arondera ingene yokwica Zakariya. Amuterera imbere y’abantu, amwiciraho, aca aramusubirira nk’umwami. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Zakariya vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Uko ni ko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryavugishijwe kuri Yehu ryashitse. Ryavuga riti: “Uruvyaro rwawe ruzokwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami bwa Isirayeli gushika ku runganwe rugira kane.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shalumu umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Shalumu mwene Yabeshi yabaye umwami wa Isirayeli mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’umunani Uziya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, atwarira i Samariya ukwezi kumwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Maze Menahemu mwene Gadi ava i Tiriza aduga i Samariya, atera Shalumu mwene Yabeshi, aramwica, aca aramusubirira nk’umwami.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Shalumu n’ivy’abo yateguye kwica, vyanditse mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Ico gihe Menahemu atera Tifusa n’imihana ihegereye gushika i Tiriza, arahatikiza kuko abantu baho banse kwishikana kuri we. Yica abantu bose, afomoza n’abagore bafise inda.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Menahemu umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’icenda Azariya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, Menahemu mwene Gadi ni ho yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwarira i Samariya imyaka cumi. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze akanabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Maze Puli umwami wa Ashuri atera igihugu ca Isirayeli, Menahemu amuha italanto igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 38.</char></note> z’ifeza, kugira ngo amufashe gukomeza ubwami bwiwe, anamufashe no kuguma ku ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahemu akura ayo mahera mu butunzi bwa Isirayeli. Umutunzi wese yasabwa gutanga n’imiburiburi shekeli mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note> z’ifeza zo guha umwami wa Ashuri. Maze umwami wa Ashuri ntiyaba agitera Isirayeli, ava no muri ico gihugu asubira inyuma.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Menahemu, n’ivyo yakoze vyose, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahemu arahava ahamvya ba sekuruza, umuhungu wiwe Pekahiya aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Pekahiya umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itanu Azariya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, ni ho Pekahiya mwene Menahemu yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwarira i Samariya imyaka ibiri. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Pekahiya akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze akanabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Umwe mu bakuru b’intwazangabo bakuru yitwa Peka, mwene Remaliya, arondera ingene amwica. Ahitana abasoda mirongo itanu i Gileyadi bajana na we, yica Pekahiya, amwicana na Arugobu na Ariyehi abicira mu nzu imwe yo ku kirimba i Samariya. Uko ni ko Peka yishe Pekahiya aca amusubirira ku ngoma nk’umwami w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Pekahiya hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Peka umwami wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itanu na kabiri Azariya ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, ni ho Peka mwene Remaliya yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwara imyaka mirongo ibiri aba i Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakoze akanabikwegeramwo Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Ku ngoma ya Peka, umwami wa Isirayeli, Tigulati-Pileseri umwami wa Ashuri ni ho yigarurira Iyoni, Abeli-Beti-Mayaka, Yanowa, Kedeshi na Hazori. Yongera afata Gileyadi na Galilaya harimwo n’intara yose ya Nafutali, atwara n’abantu mu buja. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Maze Hoseya mwene Ela arondera ingene yica Peka mwene Remaliya. Aramutera aramwica, aca aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma. Aho hari mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri Yotamu mwene Uziya ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Peka hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yotamu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Mu mwaka ugira kabiri Peka mwene Remaliya ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli, Yotamu mwene Uziya ni ho yaba umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka icumi n’itandatu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yerusha, umukobwa wa Zadoki. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza, nk’uko se Uziya yakora. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Ariko ntiyashoboye gukuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi; abantu babandanije gushikanirayo ibimazi no gutuririraho ibimota neza. Yotamu ni we yasanuye Irembo ryo Haruguru y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yotamu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Muri ico gihe ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatangura kuja ararungika Rezini, umwami w’i Siriya, hamwe na Peka mwene Remaliya, gutera i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yotamu arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca sekuruza Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Ahazi aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ahazi umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’indwi Peka mwene Remaliya ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli, Ahazi mwene Yotamu ni ho yaba umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahazi yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’itandatu ari i Yerusalemu. Ariko ntiyakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yakora. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Yagendeye mu ngeso z’abami ba Isirayeli, mbere agera n’aho atanga umuhungu wiwe ngo aturirwe nk’ikimazi. Uko ni ko yakoze ibizira vy’ubuyobe vyakorwa n’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye muri ico gihugu imbere y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Atanga ibimazi yongera aturira n’ibimota neza, abikorera hejuru mu mataba y’imisozi miremire no musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Rezini umwami w’i Siriya na Peka mwene Remaliya umwami wa Isirayeli baduga gutera Yerusalemu, bugariza Ahazi ariko ntibashobora kumufata. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Ico gihe, Rezini umwami w’i Siriya ni ho yasubira kwigarurira igisagara ca Elati kuri Siriya, mu kuhirukana Abayuda. Abanyedomu baciye bimukira muri ico gisagara ca Elati, ni ho bakiba gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ahazi aca atuma kuri Tigulati-Pileseri, umwami w’i Ashuri, ati: “Ndi umusavyi wawe, kandi ndi musi y’ubutware bwawe. Ntabara uze unkize umwami w’i Siriya n’uwa Isirayeli, banteye.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ahazi afata inzahabu n’ifeza vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu bubiko bw’ingoro y’i bwami, abirungikira umwami w’i Ashuri nk’ishikanwa. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Umwami w’i Ashuri atera umugwa mukuru w’i Siriya ari wo Damasiko, arahafata. Abantu baho abagira imbohe, abimurira i Kiru, yongera yica umwami Rezini.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Hanyuma Ahazi aca aja i Damasiko kubonana na Tigulati-Pileseri umwami wa Ashuri. Ari ngaho abona igicaniro kidasanzwe i Damasiko, aca arungikira Uriya umuherezi w’i Yerusalemu igicapo caco n’ibikigize vyose, kugira ngo yubake ikindi nk’ico nyene. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Nuko Uriya yubaka ico gicaniro akurikije uko umwami yamubwiye, umwami agarutse avuye i Damasiko asanga yarahejeje kucubaka. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Umwami ashitse avuye i Damasiko, aracegera arakiraba, agishikanirako amashikanwa. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Ashikana amashikanwa yo guturira hamwe n’ay’ifu, agisukako n’ibinyobwa, akimijagirako n’amaraso y’ibimazi vy’amashimwe. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Umwami Ahazi aca yimura ca gicaniro ca mbere c’umwakaka, agikura imbere y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, agishira ku ruhande ahahera mu buraruko bw’ico gishasha.<verse eid="2KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Umwami Ahazi aca aha amategeko umuherezi Uriya ati: “Iki gicaniro kinini gishasha, uzohore ugitangirako ibimazi biturirwa vyo mu gatondo hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu yo ku mugoroba, ibimazi biturirwa vy’umwami hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu yiwe, hamwe n’ibimazi biturirwa vy’abantu bose, n’amashikanwa y’ifu yabo, hamwe n’amashikanwa yabo y’ibinyobwa. Uzomijagire amaraso y’ibimazi biturirwa vyose kuri iki gicaniro gishasha. Nayo igicaniro c’umwakaka nzomenya ico ndagikoresha.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Umuherezi Uriya abikora nk’uko umwami Ahazi yabimutegetse.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Umwami Ahazi akuraho ibikoresho vyo ku ruhande bijana n’igicaniro harimwo n’ibesani nini y’umwakaka yo gukarabiramwo, akuraho n’ibishushanyo vy’impfizi vyari bikozwe mu mwakaka iyo besani yari ihagazeko, ayitereka hasi ku mabuye. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Akuraho n’ibaraza ryari ryubatse mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryakoreshwa kw’Isabato, akuraho n’ubwinjiriro bw’umwami bwo hanze. Ivyo vyose yabikoze kugira ngo anezereze umwami wa Ashuri.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ahazi hamwe n’ibindi vyose yakoze, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahazi arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Maze umuhungu wiwe Hezekiya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Hoseya umwami wa nyuma wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri Ahazi ari ku ngoma i Buyuda, Hoseya mwene Ela ni ho yaba umwami wa Isirayeli, atwara imyaka umunani aba i Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, ariko ntiyanganya n’abami baganje imbere yiwe.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Shalumaneseri umwami wa Ashuri aduga gutera Hoseya, aramunesha, maze Abisirayeli bategekwa kwama batanga amashikanwa yo kwisaba menshi ku mwaka ku mwaka, bayaha Ashuri. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Mu nyuma umwami wa Ashuri amenya ko Hoseya ariko ararondera kumugarariza mu kurungika intumwa ku mwami So wa Egiputa, kugira ngo amufashe kwikura musi y’agacinyizo ka Ashuri. Ivyo vyatumye Shalumaneseri aca amufata amushira mw’ibohero. <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Umwami w’i Ashuri araza atera igihugu cose ashika i Samariya, arahugariza kumara imyaka itatu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Mu mwaka ugira icenda Hoseya ari ku ngoma, umwami wa Ashuri afata Samariya, atwara Abisirayeli bose mu buja, abimurira ahitwa Halahi mu ntara ya Gozani hafi y’uruzi Habori mu bisagara vy’Abamedi.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyaha vyatumye Abisirayeli bajanwa nk’inyagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Ivyo vyose vyabaye kw’ihanga ry’Abisirayeli kuko bacumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, yabakuye muri Egiputa, musi y’ububasha bwa Farawo umwami wa Egiputa, hanyuma bagasenga izindi mana. <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />Bagendeye mu ngeso z’abanyamahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye imbere yabo, no mu bikorwa bibi abami ba Isirayeli bigeneye gukora. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Abisirayeli bakoreye mw’ibanga n’ibindi bidahimbara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. Biyubakiye ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi mu bisagara vyose kuva ku minara y’abarinzi gushika mu bisagara vyubatswe neza. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Biyubakira ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vy’amabuye n’inkingi za Ashera ku misozi miremire no musi y’ibiti bininibinini. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Baturirira ibimota neza ku misozi nk’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye imbere yabo. Bakoze ibibi vyinshi vyatumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarakira. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Basenze ibigirwamana, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabihanikirije ngo ntibaze bakore ikintu nk’ico. <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaburiye Isirayeli n’Ubuyuda aciye ku bavugishwa n’abateramyi biwe, avuga ati: “Nimuve mu nzira zanyu mbi. Mukurikize amategeko n’amabwirizwa yanje yose ari mu Vyagezwe, ivyo nahaye ba sogokuruza banyu nkongera nkabibaha nciye ku basavyi n’abavugishwa banje.”<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Ariko ntibamwumviye, bakomantaza imitima nka ba sekuruza, batigeze bemera kwizera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Bataye amategeko yiwe hamwe n’isezerano yagiranye na ba sekuruza, hamwe n’imburi yagiye arabarungikira. Bakurikiye ibigirwamana ata co bimaze, amaherezo na bo bacika imburakimazi nka vyo. Bagendeye mu ngeso z’amahanga abakikuje, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabihanikirije ati: “Ntimuzokwigenze nk’uko bigenza,” ariko bakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarababujije.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Bashiburiye kure amategeko y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, bicurira ibigirwamana bibiri mw’ishusho y’impfizi, bishingira n’inkingi ya Ashera. Bunamira inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru, bongera basenga Bayali. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Bagera n’aho batanga abana babo nk’ibimazi ku bicaniro, bagendera mu bupfumu no kuraguza, biyegurira gukora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bituma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bubaziriringira.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni bwo bwatumye abirukana mu nyonga ziwe, hasigara umuryango wa Yuda wonyene. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Ariko Abayuda na bo nyene ntibagendeye mu mabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. Bagendeye mu nzira z’ivyaha nk’ivy’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaheba Abisirayeli, akabateza ivyago, akabarekurira mu maboko y’ababanyaga utwabo gushika n’aho abomora akabakura mu nyonga ziwe.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaze gukura Abisirayeli ku bwami bwa Dawidi, bimitse Yerobowamu mwene Nebati nk’umwami wabo. Yerobowamu akwegera Abisirayeli kure y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, atuma bakora ivyaha vyinshi. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Abisirayeli bagendera mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu, ntibigera babivamwo, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />gushika aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abirukana imbere yiwe, nk’uko yari yarabivugishije abasavyi biwe bose ari bo bavugishwa. Ni co catumye Abisirayeli batwarwa nk’inyagano muri Ashuri, ari na yo bakiri gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamahanga baza kuba i Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Maze umwami wa Ashuri azana abantu abakuye i Babiloni, i Kuta, muri Ava, muri Hamati n’i Sefaruvayimu, abashira mu bisagara vya Samariya, basubirira Abisirayeli. Nuko bigarurira Samariya n’ibisagara vyaho, babibamwo. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Bakihashika ntibasenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bituma arungika intare zica abatari bake muri bo. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Maze haza intumwa ku mwami wa Ashuri imubwira iti: “Abantu watwaye ukabakwiragiza mu bisagara vy’i Samariya ntibazi ingene basenga imana yaho. Ni co gituma yarungitse intare muri bo, ubu zikaba ziri mu kubamara.”<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Maze umwami wa Ashuri aca atanga itegeko ati: “Nimufate umuherezi umwe mu bo mwazanye mu buja, mumurungike asubire i Samariya, yigishe abimukiyeyo ivyagezwe vy’imana y’ico gihugu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Nuko umuherezi umwe mu bari batwawe bava i Samariya asubirayo, aba i Beteli, yigisha ababayo gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Ariko na ho nyene, imigwi itandukanye y’abanyamahanga yikorera imana zayo, mu bisagara babamwo, bashira ibigirwamana mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo Abisirayeli bari barubatse. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Abari bavuye i Babiloni basenga Sukoti-Benoti, abavuye i Kuta bagasenga Nerugali, abavuye i Hamati na bo bagasenga Ashima. <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Abari bavuye muri Awa basenga imana zabo Nibati na Tarutaki. Abari bavuye i Sefaruvayimu baturira abana babo bwite nk’ibimazi vyo gushikanira Adurameleki na Anameleki. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Barasenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ariko bashiraho n’abantu batandukanye babagira abaherezi bo gushikana ibimazi mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Kandi naho basenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> babandanije kumubangikanya no gukorera imana zabo bamwebamwe bose ukurikije ukuntu bari basanzwe babikora mu mahanga baje bavamwo.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Kugeza n’ubu baracashishikara iyo migenzo yabo. Ntibasenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> canke ngo bakurikize amabwirizwa, amategeko n’Ivyagezwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahaye uruvyaro rwa Yakobo, uwo yahavuye yita Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagirana isezerano n’Abisirayeli, yari yababwiye ati: “Ntimuzosenge izindi mana, ngo muzipfukamire, canke ngo muzikorere, muzishikanire n’ibimazi. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Muzosenge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene, uwabakuje muri Egiputa ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi, azobe ari we wenyene musenga. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Muzokwame mukurikiza Ivyagezwe, amabwirizwa n’amategeko, ntihaze hagire izindi mana musenga. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Ntimuzokwigere mwibagira isezerano nabagiriye, ngo musenge izindi mana. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, azobe ari we musenga wenyene, kuko ari we azobakiza abansi banyu.”<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Ariko ntibamwumviye, bigumiye mu ngeso zabo za kera. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />N’abo bantu bashasha iyo basenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bamubangikanya n’ibigirwamana. Kandi gushika n’ubu, abuzukuru n’abuzukuruza babo baracakora ibikorwa nk’ivya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu Hoseya mwene Ela umwami wa Isirayeli ari ku ngoma, ni ho Hezekiya mwene Ahazi yaba umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’icenda ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina yitwa Abiya, umukobwa wa Zakariya. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yakora. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Akuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi, amenagura inkingi z’amabuye, atemagura n’inkingi za Ashera. Amenagura na ya nzoka y’umwakaka Mose yamanika ku giti, ayigira ifu, kuko bari basigaye bayisenga, bakayituririra n’ibimota neza. Iyo nzoka y’umwakaka bayita Nehushitani.<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekiya yizeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli. Nta mwami yogereranywa na we, haba mu batwaye i Buyuda imbere yiwe canke abatwaye inyuma yiwe. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Yifatanije n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntiyigera amuvako, yitondera ivyagezwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahaye Mose. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabanye na we, amuha kugira umugisha mu vyo yakora vyose, yiganzura umwami wa Ashuri, ntiyaba akimuha amashikanwa y’agacinyizo. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Yanesheje Ubufilisitiya gushika i Gaza n’ibisagara vyaho vyose.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Mu mwaka ugira kane umwami Hezekiya ari ku ngoma, hari mu mwaka ugira indwi Hoseya mwene Ela ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli, ni ho Shalumaneseri umwami w’i Ashuri yatera i Samariya akahugariza. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Inyuma y’imyaka itatu ni ho Ashuri yafata Samariya. Hari mu mwaka ugira gatandatu Hezekiya ari ku ngoma, hakaba mu mwaka ugira icenda Hoseya ari ku ngoma muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Umwami wa Ashuri atwara Abisirayeli nk’abaja, abimurira i Halahi, mu ntara ya Gozani ku nkengera y’uruzi Habori no mu bisagara vy’Abamedi. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Ivyo vyabaye kuko batumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, bagata isezerano; ntibumvire ivyo Mose umusavyi w’Uhoraho yabategetse. Ntibumviye ivyagezwe ngo babigenderemwo.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kane umwami Hezekiya ari ku ngoma, Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri atera ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye vyose vy’i Buyuda, arabifata. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Hezekiya Umwami w’i Buyuda araheza arungikira ubutumwa umwami wa Ashuri aho yari i Lakishi amubwira ati: “Naragucumuyeko. Ndagusavye usubire inyuma, nanje nzoheza ntange amashikanwa y’agacinyizo yose uzontegeka gutanga.” Umwami wa Ashuri aca ategeka Hezekiya gutanga italanto amajana atatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 11.</char></note> z’ifeza hamwe n’iz’inzahabu mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’itoni 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Nuko Hezekiya amuha ifeza zose zari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe no mu bubiko bw’ikirimba.<verse eid="2KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Hezekiya yongera yomorora inzahabu zari ku miryango no ku bishimaryango vy’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aziha umwami wa Ashuri.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu asugereza Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Naho vyabaye gutyo, umwami w’i Ashuri aca arungika kizigenza mu ntwaramiheto, umukuru w’ingabo, n’umukuru w’ikambi, bava i Lakishi bajana n’ingabo nyinshi cane, bagiye gusugereza umwami Hezekiya i Yerusalemu. Bashitseyo, bahagarara ku mugende utwara amazi ku rugomero rwo haruguru, kw’ibarabara rija kw’Itongo ry’Umumesuzi. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Baca batumako umwami, ariko umwami arungika Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya umukuru w’ikirimba, na Shebuna umunyamabanga w’umwami, na Yowa mwene Asafu umwanditsi, baba ari bo baja guhura na bo.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Maze Umukuru w’ingabo za Ashuri ababwira ati: “Mubwire Hezekiya muti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2KI 18:19">‘Umwami ahambaye, ari we mwami w’i Ashuri avuze ngo: Mbega wishimirije iki? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Uvuga ngo ufise ubuhinga bwo kugwana ukagira n’ingabo nyinshi. Ariko ivyo ni amajambo gusa ata co amaze. Mbe wishimirije nde yotuma ungarariza? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Mbega wishimiye Egiputa? Rirya renga rivunitse ricumita mu kiganza uwo wese aryishimikije! Uko ni ko Farawo umwami wa Egiputa ameze ku bamwizigira bose. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Niwaba na ho ugira uti: “Twishimikije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu,” mbega si wewe nyene Hezekiya wayisamburiye ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi hamwe n’ibicaniro, ukabwira Ubuyuda na Yerusalemu uti: “Muzohora musengera imbere y’igicaniro c’i Yerusalemu honyene”?<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />None rero, ingo muhige na databuja, umwami w’i Ashuri. Nanje ndaguha amafarasi ibihumbi bibiri, nimba unafise abashobora kuyagenderako! <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Mbega none wewe, woshobora gute kwirukana intwazangabo naho yoba ari imwe yo mu ngabo za databuja zo hanyuma y’izindi, naho wozanana n’imikogote n’abagwanira ku mafarasi b’Abanyegiputa? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Turetse n’ivyo, mbe wibaza ko twaje gutera no gusambura aha hantu ata co <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatubwiye? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubwiwe ni we yambwiye kuza gutera iki gihugu no kugisangangura.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Maze Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya na Shebuna na Yowa babwira uwo mukuru bati: “Turakwinginze twebwe abasavyi bawe utubwire mu Carameya, kuko tucumva. Ntubandanye uvuga mu Giheburayo abantu bose bari ku ruzitiro bavyumva.”<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Ariko uwo mukuru w’ingabo abishura ati: “Mbega mwibaza ko databuja yarungikiye ubutumwa shobuja wenyene? N’abo bari ku ruzitiro nibavyumve kuko nimutishikana, tuzobugariza mwicwe n’inzara n’inyota gushika aho murya umwanda mukuru wanyu, munywe n’umwanda mutoya wanyu.”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Maze uwo mukuru w’ingabo arahaguruka avuga n’ijwi rirenga mu Giheburayo ati: “Nimwumve ijambo ry’umwami ahambaye, ari we mwami w’i Ashuri! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Avuze ngo: Ntimwemere ko Hezekiya abahenda. Ntashobora kubakiza ngo abakure mu kuboko kwanje. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Ntahave abahenda ngo mwizere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwira ngo: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azodukiza, ntazokwemera ko iki gisagara kigwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri.’<verse eid="2KI 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Ntimwumvirize Hezekiya. Ibi ni vyo umwami w’i Ashuri abamenyesheje: Nimurondere amahoro mu kwishikana iwanje. Ni ho umwe wese muri mwebwe azorya ku nzabibu no ku nsukoni ziwe, akanywa no ku mazi y’iriba ryiwe, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />gushika aho nzobatwarira mu gihugu kimeze nk’iki c’iwanyu, igihugu kirimwo ingano n’umuvinyu mushasha, igihugu cuzuye indya n’imizabibu, igihugu c’imyelayo n’ubuki; maze muzobaho, ntimuzopfa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 18:32">Ariko ntimwumvire Hezekiya kuko azoba ariko arabahenda niyababwira ati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoturokora.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Mbega hari imana z’ihanga na rimwe zigeze zirokora igihugu cazo mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Ashuri? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Mbega imana z’i Hamati n’i Arupadi ziri hehe? Imana z’i Sefaruvayimu, iz’i Hena no muri Iwa ziri hehe? Mbega zarakijije Samariya mu maboko yanje? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Mbega mu mana zose z’ivyo bihugu, ni izihe zashoboye kubikiza ukuboko kwanje? None <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yokiza Yerusalemu mu maboko yanje?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Ariko abantu bari ngaho baguma banumye, ntihagira ico bishura, kuko umwami yari yabihanikirije ati: “Ntihagire na kimwe mumwishura.”<verse eid="2KI 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Maze Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya uwari ajejwe ikirimba, na Shebuna umunyamabanga, hamwe na Yowa mwene Asafu umwanditsi, basubira kwa Hezekiya, bitaburiyeko impuzu, bamubwira ivyo wa mukuru w’ingabo yavuze vyose.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asezerana gutabara Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Umwami Hezekiya avyumvise yitaburirako impuzu, yambara amagunira, aja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Aca arungika Eliyakimu umukuru w’ikirimba, Shebuna umunyamabanga hamwe n’abaherezi bakurira abandi, baja kuraba umuvugishwa Yesaya mwene Amozi, kandi bose bagenda bambaye amagunira. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Baramubwira bati: “Umwami Hezekiya avuze ati: Uwu ni umusi w’amagorwa, ibihano n’ibiteterwe, tumeze nka kurya umwana ageze kuvuka ariko nyina akabura inkomezi zo kumuvyara. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Kumbure <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yokwumva amajambo yose y’uwo mukuru w’ingabo, ayo yarungikanywe na shebuja umwami w’i Ashuri, yo gucokora Imana nzima; maze Uhoraho Imana yawe akabimuhanira. None rero udusengere twebwe abagisigaye.”<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Abatware b’umwami Hezekiya baja kwa Yesaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />na we aca ababwira ati: “Gende mubwire shobuja muti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ntimugire ubwoba kubera ivyo mwumvise, ari yo majambo yo kuntuka y’umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Umviriza! Ngiye kumushiramwo impwemu izotuma yumva inkuru z’ibihuha, azoca afata ingingo yo gusubira mu gihugu ciwe, aho nzotuma yicwa n’inkota.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Wa mukuru w’ingabo yumvise ko umwami w’i Ashuri yavuye i Lakishi, aca ahamagara ingabo ziwe baja kuraba umwami, basanga ariko agwanira i Libuna.<verse eid="2KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Ico gihe nyene Senakeribu aca aronka inkuru zimubwira ko Tiruhaka umwami wa Etiyopiya, azananye n’ingabo ziwe baje kumutera. Imbere yo gusubira inyuma, asigira ubutumwa Hezekiya, avuga ati: <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Mubwire Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda muti: ‘Iyo mana wishimiye ntiguhende ngo izobuza ko Yerusalemu hafatwa n’umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Ndazi ko wumvise ivyo abami b’i Ashuri bakoreye ayandi mahanga, ingene babaranduye bakabamara. None wibaza ko wewe uzorokoka? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Mbega imana z’ayo mahanga yatikijwe na ba sogokuruza zarayakingiye? Za mana za Gozani, Harani, Rezefu n’abantu bo muri Edeni baba i Teli Asari, zarashoboye kubakiza? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Mbega umwami w’i Hamati ari hehe canke umwami w’i Arupadi? Abami b’ibisagara vya Sefaruvayimu, Hena na Iwa bari hehe?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiya yambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Maze Hezekiya yakira ikete ahawe n’intumwa ararisoma, aca aduga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arizingururira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya Isirayeli, wewe wicaye ku ntebe y’inganji hagati y’abakerubi, ni wewe Mana wenyene mu bwami bwose bwo kw’isi. Ni wewe waremye ijuru n’isi. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Tega ugutwi Mana yanje, wumve. Utereze inyonga zawe urabe, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; wumve amajambo Senakeribu yarungitse yo gucokora Imana nzima.<verse eid="2KI 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ni ivy’ukuri ko abami b’i Ashuri batikije ayo mahanga yose n’ibihugu vyayo. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Bataye imana zabo mu muriro barazitikiza, kuko zitari Imana, vyari ibiti n’amabuye, vyakozwe n’amaboko y’abana b’abantu. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yacu, dukize udukure mu maboko yiwe, kugira ngo ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi buzomenye ko wewe wenyene, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ari wewe Mana.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesaya avugishwa kw’itembagazwa rya Senakeribu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Yesaya mwene Amozi arungikira ubutumwa Hezekiya avuga ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Numvise ugusenga kwawe ku vyerekeye Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Aya ni yo majambo Uhoraho amurungikiye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Umukobwa w’i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">aragukengereye kandi aragutwenze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Umukobwa w’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">akuzungurije umutwe akuraba ingene uhunga.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Mbega wibaza ko uwo watutse ukongera ukamucokora ari nde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Ni nde warengeje urwamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">ukamurabisha amaso yawe y’agakengerwe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Ni Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Watumye intumwa zawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ziza kuntuka jewe Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Uravuga uti: ‘Naduganye imikogote yanje myinshi nshika hejuru ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ndetse nshika no kw’isonga rya Libani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Niciye amasederi asumvya ayandi uburebure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">n’ubujwari busumvya ubundi ubwiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Narahagendagenze nshika no mu bibanza vyaho vya kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ngenzura n’amashamba yaho atotahaye cane.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Nimvye amariba mu yandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">nywa n’amazi yaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Mponyangisha ibirenge vyanje inzuzi za Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">gushika aho zikama.’<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />Mbega ntiwari bwavyumve?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Ivyo vyose ni jewe nagenye ko bizoba kuva kera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Nabiteguye kera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">none ubu ndabishikije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">ntuma ufata ibisagara bifise inzitiro zikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">ubihindura ibirundo vy’amabuye.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Abantu bo muri vyo wabamaze amanyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">bacika ivutu, baramaramara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bameze nk’ivyatsi vyo mu gahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">nk’ubwatsi bukimera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bameze nk’utwatsi twimeza ku nzu hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">dukabirana tutarakura.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Ariko ndakuzi neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ndazi aho uri, ndazi amaja n’amaza yawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ndazi n’ingene wandakiye.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />None rero ko wandakiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">amajambo yawe atagira indero agashika mu matwi yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">nzogutungira igera mu zuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">ndagushire umunyororo mu kanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">ndagusubize inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">uciye mu nzira wazananye.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Yewe Hezekiya, iki ni co kimenyetso uhawe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Uwu mwaka uzorya ivyimejeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">umwaka ukurikira uzorya ibizonaga kuri vyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Ariko ku mwaka ugira gatatu, uzobiba wimbure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">utere imizabibu, urye ku vyamwa vyayo.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Nayo amasigarira y’abacitse kw’icumu yo mu muryango wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">azokwongera amere nk’igiti gishora imizi mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">maze hejuru amashami na yo akama ivyamwa.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Kuko i Yerusalemu hazokwamuka amasigarira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">no ku musozi Siyoni have abacitse kw’icumu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2KI 19:31">Ishaka ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo rizoshitsa ivyo.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Ku bw’ivyo, uku ni ko Uhoraho avuze ku mwami w’i Ashuri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">‘Ntazokwinjira mu gisagara c’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">canke ngo araseyo umwampi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">Ntazokwegera inzitiro yitwaje inkinzo yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">canke ngo azubakeko ivyo kwuririrako ngo ahatere.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Inzira yazananye ni yo izomusubiza inyuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">ntazokwinjira iki gisagara,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />‘Nzogwanira iki gisagara ndakirokore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">ku bwanje no ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Iryo joro nyene umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araza, atera insago z’Abashuri, yica ingabo ibihumbi ijana na mirongo umunani na bitanu. Abantu bavyutse mu gitondo basanga imivyimba irambaraye ahantu hose. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Maze Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri aca asubira inyuma, aja kuba i Ninewe agumayo.<verse eid="2KI 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Umusi umwe, Senakeribu ari mu ngoro ya Nisuroki imana yiwe ariko arasenga, abahungu biwe Adurameleki na Sharezeri baraza bamwicisha inkota, bahungira mu gihugu c’i Ararati. Umuhungu wiwe Esaruhadoni aca amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiya afatwa n’ingwara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Muri iyo misi, Hezekiya aragwara, ashika ku mpfiro. Umuvugishwa Yesaya mwene Amozi aja kumuraba, amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ngo: ‘Tunganya ivyo mu rugo rwawe, kuko ugiye gupfa, ntuzokira.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Maze aca ahindukiriza amaso ku ruhome, asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ibuka ingene nagendeye imbere yawe mu bwizigirwa nkagukorera nguhaye umutima wanje wose, ngakora ivyo ubona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga zawe.” Hezekiya ararira cane.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Ariko imbere y’uko Yesaya arengana mu rugo ataha, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimuzako, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />riti: “Subira inyuma ubwire Hezekiya, umutware w’ubwoko bwanje uti, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya sogokuruza Dawidi avuze: ‘Numvise ugusenga kwawe, kandi nabonye amarira yawe, none ngiye kugukiza. Inyuma y’imisi itatu uzoduga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Nzokwongera iyindi myaka cumi n’itanu yo kubaho. Kandi wewe n’iki gisagara nzobakiza amaboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri. Nzogwanira iki gisagara ku bw’izina ryanje no ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Maze Yesaya avuga ati: “Nimutegure akarobe kabumvye mu nsukoni.” Barakazana, bagashira ku kivyimba, Hezekiya aca arakira.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hezekiya abaza Yesaya ati: “Ikimenyetso kizonyereka ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yankijije, ngashobora gusubira kuduga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> inyuma y’imisi itatu ni ikihe?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Yesaya aramwishura ati: “Iki ni co kimenyetso ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokora ivyo yasezeranye: Ushaka ko igitutu kija imbere yawe amatambwe cumi canke inyuma yawe amatambwe cumi?”<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekiya yishura ati: “Ni ibisanzwe ko igitutu kija imbere amatambwe cumi, ahubwo nikije inyuma amatambwe cumi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Maze Yesaya yambaza izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we ahindukiza igitutu gisubira inyuma ya Ahazi amatambwe cumi.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zavuye i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Muri ico gihe nyene, Merodaki-Baladani mwene Baladani, umwami w’i Babiloni, arungikira Hezekiya amakete yo kumusuhuza hamwe n’utuganuke, kuko yari yumvise ko yagwaye. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hezekiya yakira neza abazanye ubwo butumwa, abereka mu nzu hose n’ivyari mu bubiko vyose: ifeza, inzahabu, ibimota neza, amavuta, abereka n’imyambaro y’intambara, hamwe n’ibindi vyose vyari mu bubiko bwiwe. Nta na kimwe cari ku kirimba canke mu bwami bwose ataberetse.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Umuvugishwa Yesaya aragenda abaza umwami Hezekiya ati: “Abo bantu bakubwiye iki, kandi baje bava he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Baje bava mu gihugu ca kure; bavuye i Babiloni.”<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Yesaya aramubaza ati: “Babonye iki ku kirimba iwawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Babonye ibintu vyose biri mu ngoro yanje. Nta na kimwe c’ubutunzi bwanje ntaberetse.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Yesaya abwira Hezekiya ati: “Niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Hazogera igihe aho ibiri muri iyi ngoro vyose, ivyo ba sogokuruza bawe begeranije gushika uwu musi, bizotwarwa i Babiloni. Nta na kimwe kizosigara, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Kandi bamwe bo mu ruvyaro rwawe, abana bawe bwite, bazogukomokako, uwundi azoza abatware, bagirwe inkone ku kirimba c’umwami w’i Babiloni.”<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uvuze ni ryiza.” Aho rero ni kubera yibwira mu mutima ati: “Kazima mu gihe nzoba nkiriho hazoba hari amahoro.”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Hezekiya, ivyo yashitseko, ingene yubatse ikidengeri, n’ingene yubatse umugende uca mu kuzimu uzana amazi mu gisagara, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Maze Hezekiya ahamvya ba sekuruza, umuhungu wiwe Manase amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Manase, umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase yabaye umwami afise imyaka cumi n’ibiri, aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’itanu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Hefiziba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Manase akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu bizira vy’ubuyobe vyakorwa n’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye imbere y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Asubira kwubaka ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi, ivyo se Hezekiya yari yarasanganguye; yongera kwubaka ibicaniro vya Bayali n’inkingi ya Ashera, nk’uko Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli yari yarakoze. Yunamira ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru, arabisenga. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Yubaka ibicaniro mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho, iyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaravuzeko ati: “I Yerusalemu nzohashira izina ryanje.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Mu rugo rwose rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahubaka ibicaniro vy’ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Agera n’aho atanga umuhungu wiwe kw’ikimazi co guturirwa, agendera mu bupfumu n’amareba, ahanuza abahamagara imizimu hamwe na ba kamenyi. Akora ibibi vyinshi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bituma amuratsa.<verse eid="2KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Afata inkingi ya Ashera yabazishije, ayishira mu Ngoro, imwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabwiye Dawidi n’umuhungu wiwe Salomo ati: “Muri iyi Ngoro, n’i Yerusalemu, ni ho natoranije mu yindi miryango yose ya Isirayeli, ngo hitirirwe izina ryanje ibihe vyose. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Sinzosubira gutuma Abisirayeli bayerera ngo bave mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza babo nibagendera mu vyo nabategetse vyose, bagakurikiza Ivyagezwe vyose umusavyi wanje Mose yabahaye.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Ariko abantu ntibayumviye. Manase yarabazimije, atuma bava mu nzira z’Uhoraho, bakora ibibi birengeye ivy’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarahonereje imbere y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avugisha abasavyi biwe b’abavugishwa, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />ati: “Manase, umwami w’i Buyuda, yakoze ivyaha birenze urugero. Yakoze ibibi bisumba ivy’Abamori baba mu gihugu imbere y’Abisirayeli, akwegera Abayuda mu vyaha vyo gusenga ibigirwamana. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze ati: Nzotera amakuba Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda hose, gushika aho abazovyumva bose bazojorerwa. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />I Yerusalemu nzohacira urubanza nk’urwo naciriye Samariya, ndahagerere no ku ngero nagereyeko umuryango wa Ahabu. Nzohanagura ababa i Yerusalemu nk’uwuhanagura isahani hanyuma akayubika. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Nzokwanka amasigarira y’ubwoko bwanje, ndabarekurire mu maboko y’abansi babo. Bazotwarwa ari inyagano ku bansi babo, <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />kuko bakoze ibizira mu nyonga zanje, bantera kubarakarira uhereye igihe nabakura muri Egiputa gushika n’uwu musi.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Ikigeretseko, Manase yasheshe amaraso y’abantu benshi ata co bazira, yuzura igisagara ca Yerusalemu uhereye iyo kiva kikagera. Ivyo vyiyongera ku vyaha yakwegeyemwo Abayuda, bakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Manase n’ivyo yakoze vyose, harimwo n’ivyaha vyiwe, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Haheze igihe, Manase ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa mw’itongo ryo ku kirimba iwe, mw’itongo ryitwa irya Uza. Umuhungu wiwe yitwa Amoni aca aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Amoni umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amoni yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Meshulemeti umukobwa wa Haruzi w’i Yotiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Manase yakoze. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Yagendeye mu ngeso zose za se; yasenze ibigirwamana se yasenga, akama yikubita imbere yavyo. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Ava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza, ntiyigera agendera mu nzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na gatoya.<verse eid="2KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Maze abaganwa ba Amoni baja inama yo kumwica, bamutsinda mu ngoro iwe. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Ariko abantu bo muri ico gihugu baca bafata abishe umwami Amoni barabica, bimika Yosiya umuhungu wiwe, aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Amoni hamwe n’ivyo yakoze, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Yahambwe mw’itongo ryitwa irya Uza, umuhungu wiwe Yosiya aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Igitabu c’Ivyagezwe gitorwa mu ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Yosiya yari afise imyaka umunani igihe yaba umwami, aca aganza imyaka mirongo itatu n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yedida, umukobwa wa Adaya, w’i Bozikati. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu nzira zose za sekuruza Dawidi, ntiyahengamira i buryo canke i bubamfu.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani ari ku ngoma, umwami Yosiya ahamagara umunyamabanga wiwe yitwa Shafani mwene Azaliya, Azaliya mwene Meshulamu, amutuma mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />Amubwira ati: “Genda ubwire Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru, yegeranye amahera yatanzwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ayo abakozi bo ku miryango y’ingoro bari begeranije ava mu bantu. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Maze ayahe abantu b’abizigirwa, bagenewe gukurikirana neza ibikorwa vyo mu Ngoro. Abo bantu na bo bazohembe abazokora ibikorwa vyo gusanura Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />ababaji n’abubatsi, maze bongere bagure imbaho, babazishe n’amabuye yo gusanura Ingoro. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Ariko ntibazokwirirwa barabazwa uko bazoba bakoresheje amahera bahawe, kuko ari abizigirwa.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru abwira Shafani umwanditsi ati: “Ndatoye Igitabu c’Ivyagezwe mu Ngoro y’Uhoraho.” Aca agiha Shafani, na we aragisoma. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Maze Shafani asubira inyuma abarira umwami ati: “Abatware bawe batanze amahera yari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bayahaye abo bizeye ko bokurikirana ibikorwa vyo mu Ngoro.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Yongera abwira umwami ati: “Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru yampaye iki gitabu.” Hanyuma Shafani agisomera imbere y’umwami.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Maze umwami yumvise amajambo yo muri ico Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe, aca yitaburirako impuzu. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Aca ategeka Hilukiya umuherezi, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, Akibori mwene Mikaya, Shafani umunyamabanga w’umwami na Asaya umukozi w’umwami ati: <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Nimugende munsigurize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> jewe n’abantu n’ab’i Buyuda bose ku vyerekeye ivyanditswe muri iki gitabu catowe. Uburake bw’Uhoraho bwasutswe kuri twebwe burateye ubwoba kuko ba sogokuruza batumviye amajambo ari muri iki gitabu, ngo bakore ibihwanye n’ivyanditswemwo.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Umuherezi Hilukiya hamwe na Ahikamu, Akibori, Shafani na Asaya baca baja kuvugana na Hulida umuvugishwa, yari umugore wa Shalumu mwene Tikiva, Tikiva mwene Haruhasi uwari ajejwe imyambaro yo mu Ngoro. Uwo Hulida yaba i Yerusalemu mu gice gishasha c’igisagara.<verse eid="2KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Na we ababwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Nimugende mubwire uwabantumyeko muti <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ngiye guteza icago aha hantu n’abantu baho, nk’uko vyanditswe mu gitabu umwami w’i Buyuda yasomye. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Kuko bantaye, bagaturirira ibimota neza izindi mana, bakandakisha ibigirwamana amaboko yabo yakoze, uburake bwanje buzoziriringira aha hantu, kandi nta kizobuhwamika. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Nimugende mubwire umwami w’i Buyuda yabatumye kumusiguriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, muti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ku vyerekeye amajambo wumvise: <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />Ko umutima wawe wakozweko, ukicisha bugufi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ucumva amajambo navuze kuri aha hantu no ku bantu baho ko bagiye guherengetera no gucika umuvumo, kandi ko witaburiyeko impuzu ukaririra imbere yanje; nanje nakwumvise, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />None rero nzoguha kwitahira amahoro uhamvye ba sogokuruza bawe. Amaso yawe ntazobona ivyago vyose ngiye guteza aha hantu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Nuko bashira umwami iyo nyishu abahaye.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosiya asubizaho isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Umwami akoranya abakuru bose b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Adugana ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’abantu bose b’i Buyuda, ababa i Yerusalemu, abaherezi hamwe n’abavugishwa, n’abantu bose uhereye ku muto ugashitsa ku mukuru. Abasomera amajambo yo muri ca Gitabu c’Isezerano cari catowe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Ahejeje ahagarara i ruhande y’inkingi, asubizaho isezerano imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko agiye kwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, no gukurikiza amabwirizwa, amategeko hamwe n’ivyagezwe vyiwe, akabikora n’umutima wiwe wose n’umushaha wiwe wose, mu gushitsa ivyanditswe muri ico gitabu. Maze abantu bose bemera gusubira muri iryo sezerano.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Umwami aca ategeka umuherezi mukuru n’abakorana na we bose, n’abarinzi b’urwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bose gukura ikintu cose cari cakorewe Bayali na Ashera hamwe n’ivy’ibinyenyeri vyo kw’ijuru. Babituririra inyuma y’igisagara ca Yerusalemu mu mwonga wa Kidironi, iminyota yavyo bayitwara i Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Yirukana abaherezi b’abanyamahanga bari bashizweho n’abami b’i Buyuda kugira ngo baze baraturirira ibimota neza ku misozi miremire yo mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda no mu yikikuje Yerusalemu. Bashikanira ibimota neza Bayali, izuba, ukwezi, inyenyeri hamwe n’ibindi vyose vyo kw’ijuru. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Asohora mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> inkingi ya Ashera bayitwara mu mwonga wa Kidironi inyuma y’igisagara ca Yerusalemu, bayituririrayo. Baca bafata umunyota wayo, baja kuwuta mw’itongo ry’abapfuye. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Yosiya yongera asambura inzu z’abamaraya b’abagabo n’abagore zari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ari na ho abagore bajishira ibitambara bapfukisha inkingi ya Ashera.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Yongera ahamagaza abaherezi bose, kuva i Geba gushika i Berisheba, bakora igikorwa c’ubuherezi mu Buyuda bwose, ahumanya ibibanza vyose vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi batangiramwo ibimazi. I Yerusalemu, amenagura ibicaniro vyose vyari hafi y’Irembo rya Yosuwa umukuru w’igisagara, vyari i bubamfu bw’urwinjiriro. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Naho abaherezi bo mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi batari bemerewe kugira ico bokora ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu, barasangira n’abandi baherezi bagenzi babo imikate itarimwo umwambiro.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Umwami yongera akuraho igicaniro ca Tofeti mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, ntihagira abasubira kuhashikanira abana babo nk’ibimazi vyo guturira babishikanira Moleki. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Akuraho amafarasi yari ku rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abami b’Abayuda bari barashikanye mu gusenga izuba. Ayo mafarasi yari mu kigo imbere, hafi y’inzu ya Natani-Meleki inkone, akaba n’umutware. Yosiya aca aturira imikogote yayo yari yarashikaniwe izuba.<verse eid="2KI 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Amenagura ibicaniro vyose abami b’i Buyuda bari bubatse hejuru ku bisenge vy’inzu ya Ahazi, asenyura n’ibicaniro vyose Manase yari yarubakishije mu mabaraza y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arabimenagura bicika ubunywenywe, hanyuma baravyegeranya baja kubita mu mwonga wa Kidironi. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Umwami akuraho n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi vyari mu buseruko bwa Yerusalemu hepfo y’ivyo umwami Salomo yari yarubakiye ikigirwamanakazi Ashitaroti y’Abanyesidoni, Kemoshi imana y’Abanyamowabu, na Moleki imana y’Abamoni <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Yowashi amenagura amabuye y’ibiterekerwa, atemagura inkingi za Ashera, aho vyari aharenzako amagufa y’abantu.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />N’ibicaniro vy’i Beteli hamwe n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi vyubatswe na Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, yari yakwegeye Abisirayeli mu vyaha, vyose arabimenagura. Aturira ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi, bicika iminyota, aturira n’inkingi ya Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Yosiya aravye hirya no hino abona imva nyinshi ku musozi. Aca ategeka ko bazikuramwo amagufa yose, hanyuma ayaturirira kuri ico gicaniro c’i Beteli kugira ngo agihumanye. Ivyo vyabaye nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabivugishije umuntu wayo igihe Yerobowamu yari ahagaze i ruhande y’igicaniro mu misi mikuru. Maze Yosiya ahindukiye akaraba ku ruhande, ni ho yabona imva y’umuntu w’Imana yabivugishijwe.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Aca arabaza ati: “Kiriya cibutso mbona hariya ni ic’iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Abantu bo muri ico gisagara baramwishura bati: “Ni imva y’umuntu w’Imana w’i Buyuda yavugishijwe ibi vyose uhejeje gukorera iki gicaniro c’i Beteli.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Na we arababwira ati: “Nimuyireke, ntihagire uwukomakoma amagufa yiwe.” Nuko amagufa yiwe barayarengana, co kimwe n’ay’abandi bavugishwa bari bavuye i Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Yosiya asambura n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi mu bisagara vya Samariya vyari vyubatswe n’abami ba Isirayeli bigatera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> gushangashirwa, yongera arabihumanya nk’uko yabigenjeje i Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Yosiya yongera yica abaherezi bose bo ku bicaniro vyo muri ivyo bibanza vyo gusengeramwo yongera ahumanya ivyo bicaniro mu kubituririrako amagufa y’abantu, maze asubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Umwami aca atanga itegeko ku bantu bose ati: “Muzokwame muhimbaza Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’uko vyanditswe muri iki gitabu c’Isezerano.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Ntihari bwigere hahimbazwa umusi mukuru wa Pasika nk’uwo, uhereye mu gihe abacamanza batwara igihugu ca Isirayeli ugashitsa ku bami b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Iyo Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahimbajwe mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yosiya ari ku ngoma i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Mu gukurikiza ivyo muri ico Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe cari catowe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru, Yosiya yirukana abavugana n’imizimu, imana z’imiryango, hamwe n’ibindi bigirwamana vyose vyasengwa, haba i Yerusalemu canke i Buyuda hose. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Nta mwami yigeze abaho ameze nka Yosiya, haba mu batwaye imbere yiwe canke abatwaye inyuma yiwe; yagarutse k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umutima wiwe wose n’umushaha wiwe wose, n’inkomezi ziwe zose, nk’uko Ivyagezwe vya Mose vyabivuga.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Ariko ubushangashirwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaratewe n’Ubuyuda ntibwigeze buhwama kubera ivyo Manase yari yarakoze vyose vyatumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aterwa n’ishavu ryinshi. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Nzirukana Abayuda mu maso yanje nk’uko nirukanye Abisirayeli, kandi nzokwihakana Yerusalemu, igisagara natoranije, hamwe n’Ingoro navugiyeko nti: ‘Izina ryanje rizoba muri yo.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yosiya hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda.<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Yosiya akiri ku ngoma, umwami wa Egiputa yitwa Farawo Neko aduga ku ruzi Efurate gufasha umwami w’i Ashuri. Umwami Yosiya aja kumutegera ngo amugwanye, ariko Neko amwicira i Megido aho bagwaniye. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Abantu biwe bashira ikiziga ciwe mu mukogote, bagikura i Megido, bagitwara i Yerusalemu, bamuhamba mu mva yiwe ubwiwe. Abantu bo muri ico gihugu bafata Yehowahazi mwene Yosiya bamurobanuza amavuta, ngo abe umwami mu gishingo ca se.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehowahazi umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehowahazi yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itatu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza amezi atatu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Hamutali, umukobwa wa Yeremiya w’i Libuna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko ba sekuruza bakoze. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Farawo Neko amushira mw’ibohero i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati kugira ngo ntabandanye aganza i Yerusalemu; aca ategeka Abayuda gutanga amashikanwa yo kwisaba angana n’italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note> z’ifeza n’imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 34.</char></note> y’inzahabu. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Farawo Neko aca yimika Eliyakimu uwundi muhungu wa Yosiya mu kibanza ca se, amuhindura izina, amwita Yehoyakimu. Nuko Yehowahazi ajanwa muri Egiputa, apfirayo. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoyakimu aha Farawo Neko ayo mashikanwa y’ifeza n’inzahabu yaciriye Ubuyuda. Kugira ngo ayegeranye, yatangishije amakori abanyagihugu bose b’i Buyuda, akurikije uko batunze.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoyakimu yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Zebidahi, umukobwa wa Pedaya w’i Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko ba sekuruza bakoze.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu, umwami Nebukadineza w’i Babiloni atera igihugu c’i Buyuda, Yehoyakimu amubera umusavyi kumara imyaka itatu. Ariko inyuma yaho agarariza Nebukadineza. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca arungika Abanyababiloni, Abaramu, Abanyamowabu, Abamoni n’Abasiriya, batera Ubuyuda. Barabusambura nk’uko Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryabivuze riciye ku basavyi biwe ari bo bavugishwa. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Koko ivyo vyashikiye Ubuyuda nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabitegetse, kugira ngo abirukane mu maso hiwe, ku bw’ivyaha vyose Manase yakoze, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />harimwo gusesa amaraso y’abantu ata co bazira, ayo yatembesheje nk’inzuzi i Yerusalemu, bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanka kuvyihanganira.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu hamwe n’ivyo yakoze vyose, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’Abayuda? <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Nuko Yehoyakimu ahamvya ba sekuruza, maze Yehoyakini umuhungu wiwe aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Umwami wa Egiputa ntiyabaye agisubira kuva mu gihugu ciwe, kuko umwami wa Babiloni yari yafashe igihugu cose ahereye ku kagezi ka Egiputa ugashisa ku ruzi Efurate.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Yehiyakini umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoyakini yari afise imyaka cumi n’umunani igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza amezi atatu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Nehushita mwene Elunatani w’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se yakoze.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Ku ngoma ya Yehoyakini, abakuru n’ingabo za Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni baraza bugariza igisagara ca Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />na Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni ubwiwe arishikira mu gisagara mu gihe bari bacugarije. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Yehoyakini umwami w’i Buyuda, nyina wiwe, abasavyi biwe, abatware hamwe n’abubahwa biwe bose barishikana kuri Nebukadineza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:12">Mu mwaka ugira umunani umwami w’i Babiloni ari ku ngoma, atwara Yehoyakini nk’imbohe. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabivuze, Nebukadineza atwara ubutunzi bwose bwari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu kirimba c’umwami, atwara ibikoresho vyari bicuzwe mu nzahabu Salomo umwami wa Isirayeli yari yarakoresheje akabishira mu Ngoro. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Atwara mu buja ababa i Yerusalemu bose: abatware, abasoda, abacuzi, abanyamyuga, bose hamwe bari ibihumbi cumi. Abakene bo muri ico gihugu ni bo bonyene basigaye.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Nebukadineza afata Yehoyakini, amutwara nk’imbohe i Babiloni, atwara na nyina w’umwami, abagore b’umwami, abatware biwe hamwe n’abakuru bo muri ico gihugu bose, abakuye i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Umwami wa Babiloni yongera atwara abasoda ibihumbi indwi, bakomeye cane, bamenyereye intambara, hamwe n’abacuzi n’abanyamyuga igihumbi b’abahinga. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Yimika Mataniya sewabo wa Yehoyakini nk’umwami, ahindura izina ryiwe amwita Zedekiya.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Zedekiya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’umwe igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Hamutali mwene Yeremiya w’i Libuna. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko Yehoyakimu yakoze. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Ivyo vyose vyashikiye Yerusalemu n’Ubuyuda kubera uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari bwaziririnze, akirukana abantu biwe mu maso hiwe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2KI 24:20">Yerusalemu hasamburwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Maze Zedekiya agarariza umwami w’i Babiloni.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Nuko, mu mwaka ugira icenda Zedekiya ari ku ngoma, ku musi ugira cumi w’ukwezi kw’icumi, Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aja gutera Yerusalemu ajanye n’ingabo ziwe zose. Bacumbika inyuma y’igisagara, bacubakira ivyo kwuririrako ku mpande zose. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Igisagara kiguma cugarijwe gushika mu mwaka ugira cumi na rimwe Zedekiya ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="2KI 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Ku musi ugira icenda w’ukwezi kwa kane, inzara iba nyinshi mu gisagara gushika aho abantu babura ico batamira. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Nuko, uruzitiro rw’igisagara bararusatura, maze mw’ijoro ingabo zose zirahunga ziciye mw’irembo riri hagati y’ibihome bibiri, hafi y’umurima w’umwami, naho Abanyababiloni bari bakikuje igisagara. Bahunga berekeye ikiyaya ca Yorodani citwa Araba. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Ariko ingabo z’Abanyababiloni zikurikira umwami bamufatira mu kiyaya c’i Yeriko. Abasoda biwe bose barasanzara, baramuta; <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />na we aca arafatwa, bamujana ku mwami w’i Babiloni yari i Ribula, aca amucira urubanza aho nyene. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Bicira abahungu ba Zedekiya imbere yiwe, na we bamunogora amaso, bamubohesha iminyororo, bamutwara i Babiloni.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Ku musi ugira indwi w’ukwezi kwa gatanu mu mwaka ugira cumi n’icenda Nebukadineza ari umwami w’i Babiloni, ni ho Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, akaba n’umwishikira w’umwami w’i Babiloni, yashika i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Aturira Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ikirimba c’umwami, hamwe n’ayandi mazu yose yari i Yerusalemu. Inyubakwa zose zihambaye zo mu gisagara araziturira. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Abasoda bose b’i Babiloni bari barongowe n’uwo mukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, baraza basenyura inzitiro zose z’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba, aca atwara mu kinyago abantu bose bari basigaye mu gisagara hamwe n’abasoda bari barishikanye ku mwami w’i Babiloni. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Ariko uwo mukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, asiga bamwe mu bakene bo mu gihugu ngo bakorere imizabibu n’imirima.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Abanyababiloni basenyura za nkingi z’umwakaka hamwe na ca gikarabiro c’umwakaka n’ivyo cari giteretseko vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, batwara n’umwakaka wabo i Babiloni. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Batwara n’udukono two kuyoreramwo umunyota, ivyo kuyoza umunyota, ibikombe, amapanu, hamwe n’ibindi bikoresho vyose vy’umwakaka vyakoreshwa mu Ngoro. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba atwara ibikoresho vyose vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza, harimwo amabesani n’ivyo guturirirako ibimota neza.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Umwakaka wavuye muri za nkingi zibiri, ca gikarabiro bita ikiyaga na vya bitereko biterurwa, ivyo umwami Salomo yari yarakoze ngo bibe ivyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyari bifise uburemere butashobora gupimwa ku munzane. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Inkingi imwe yose yapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi n’umunani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 8,1.</char></note> z’igihagararo. Umwashi w’umwakaka wari hejuru y’inkingi imwe wari ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,4.</char></note> z’uburebure ukaba usharijweko amakomamanga y’umwakaka awukikuje. Ku yindi nkingi, hari uwundi mwashi ufise amakomamanga yawo nk’uko nyene.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Uwo mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba agira imbohe Seraya umuherezi mukuru, Zefaniya umuherezi wa kabiri hamwe n’abarinzi b’irembo batatu. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Mu bari basigaye mu gisagara, atwara intwazangabo yatwara abasoda baja ku rugamba hamwe n’abahanuzi batanu b’umwami. Atwara n’umunyamabanga yari ajejwe kwinjiza abantu mu gisoda, hamwe n’abandi banyagihugu mirongo itandatu yasanze mu gisagara. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Iyo ntwazangabo Nebuzaradani ica ifata ba bantu bose ibashira umwami w’i Babiloni i Ribula. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Aca abicira aho nyene i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:21">Uko ni ko Abayuda batwawe mu kinyago, bakurwa mu gihugu cabo.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aca agena Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, ngo abe umutware w’abantu bari basigaye i Buyuda. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Maze intwazangabo zose n’abantu babo bumvise ko umwami w’i Babiloni yagenye Gedaliya ngo abe umukuru w’iyo ntara, baca baja kubonana na Gedaliya i Misipa. Abo na bo ni Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Yohanani na Yonatani bene Kareya, Seraya mwene Tanihumeti, bene Efayi Umunetofati, na Yazaniya umuhungu w’Umumayaka, n’abantu babo. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedaliya aca arabarahira, arabahumuriza hamwe n’abantu babo ababwira ati: “Ntimutinye abatware b’Abanyababiloni. Nimugende mube amahoro mu gihugu, muyoboke umwami w’i Babiloni, ibindi vyose bizogenda neza.”<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Ariko mu kwezi kugira indwi, Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Netaniya mwene Elishama, wo mu muryango w’abami, azanana n’abasoda cumi, bica Gedaliya ari kumwe n’Abayuda, n’Abanyababiloni i Misipa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Maze abantu bose b’i Buyuda, uhereye kuri muto ugashika kuri mukuru, bari kumwe n’abakuru mu ngabo, baterwa n’ubwoba bw’Abanyababiloni, bahungira muri Egiputa.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakini arekurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu n’indwi Yehoyakini umwami w’i Buyuda ari mu kinyago, umwaka Evili-Merodaki yimikiwemwo ngo abe umwami w’i Babiloni, ni wo yarekuriyemwo Yehoyakini ava mw’ibohero. Hari ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi w’ukwezi kwa cumi na kabiri. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Amufata neza, amuha n’ikibanza c’icubahiro gisumba ivy’abandi bami bari kumwe na we i Babiloni. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Nuko Yehoyakini ntiyasubira kwambara impuzu z’imbohe, kandi yama asangira n’umwami ku meza yiwe imisi yose yari asigaje y’ukubaho kwiwe. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Umwami yama aha Yehoyakini ku musi ku musi ivyo kumutunga imisi yose yari akiriho.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>